WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:24.958
{\an8}[narrator] <i>The winner of</i> I Am Boxer
<i>will receive a grand prize of 300 million</i>

2
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:28.194
{\an8}<i>and a top-of-the-line flagship SUV.</i>

3
00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.599
[Lee] The quarterfinals of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

4
00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.035
Each bout consists
of six three-minute rounds.

5
00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:39.272
[Seungheon] The first match prepared today
is between Kuk Seungjun and Kim Hyunjun.

6
00:00:39.339 --> 00:00:40.573
[Jongkook] He's going a bit out-boxer.

7
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:43.109
Now that the ring is big,
he's showing more movement.

8
00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:44.444
[Seungheon] Excellent uppercut!

9
00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:47.313
- [Jonghoon] Okay, nice body shot!
- [Seungheon groans]

10
00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.681
Whoa, that landed.

11
00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.050
[Gyuwon] They're pushing to end it here!

12
00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:51.785
[Lee] It's the last one,
so they're going all in.

13
00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.019
[Seungheon] There isn't much time left!

14
00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.621
- Kuk is working the body!
- [bell rings]

15
00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.890
The bout has officially ended!

16
00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.659
{\an8}[Lee] The winner is Kuk Seungjun.

17
00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.428
Let the second bout begin!

18
00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:04.564
{\an8}[Dex] Entering from the blue corner,
Pretty Boy, Cho Hyunjae!

19
00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.966
{\an8}[Jongkook] Entering from the red corner,
Blaze, Yuk Junseo!

20
00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.468
{\an8}Let's go!

21
00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.071
Man, this one's hard to tell.

22
00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.542
{\an8}YUK JUNSEO X CHO HYUNJAE

23
00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.514
Next up is the second quarterfinal bout.

24
00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.249
Yuk Junseo versus Cho Hyunjae.

25
00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:31.124
Considered one of the top elite boxers,
here's Cho Hyunjae getting warmed up!

26
00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:37.464
Facing him is Yuk Junseo,
showing confidence and constant growth!

27
00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:39.232
[spectator] Let's go, Yuk Junseo!

28
00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:40.600
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

29
00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.603
They're nearly identical physically.

30
00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:46.639
This is gonna be wild.

31
00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.642
Before the bout,
let's hear from both fighters.

32
00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:53.346
Today, I'll show you
what elite boxing really looks like.

33
00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:55.482
And Yuk Junseo,

34
00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.450
I know you like your slugfests.

35
00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:00.453
But today,
you're just going to be taking shots,

36
00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.422
- so keep your guard up tight.
- [crowd clamors]

37
00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.058
[spectator] Way to go!

38
00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:10.797
The trunks I'm wearing right now are red.

39
00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.899
By the end of this,

40
00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.568
you won't know
if that's the original color or blood.

41
00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.203
I'll turn this into a bloodbath.

42
00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.605
That's intimidating.

43
00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:21.274
Man, this one's going to be fun.

44
00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.443
These two have fought before,

45
00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:25.445
though it was three-way.
They know what's coming.

46
00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.047
[grunting]

47
00:02:35.522 --> 00:02:38.124
[Lee] The survivor of this match
is Cho Hyunjae.

48
00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.761
[Hyunjae] <i>After clashing</i>
<i>in the last fight,</i>

49
00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:43.163
I've got him all figured out.

50
00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:46.799
[Lee] In the blue corner,
Pretty Boy, Cho Hyunjae.

51
00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.003
In the red corner, Blaze, Yuk Junseo.

52
00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:56.142
[Hyunjae] <i>The moment I heard</i>
<i>my opponent's name,</i>

53
00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:58.645
I thought, "Yeah, I've got this."

54
00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:02.882
<i>When I fought Cho Hyunjae last time,</i>
<i>he was a really tough matchup for me.</i>

55
00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:04.817
But I've been through him once,

56
00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:06.819
so I know what to prepare for now.

57
00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:13.193
<i>To learn how to control</i>
<i>the pace of a fight,</i>

58
00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.028
<i>I brought in Kim Sangwook,</i>

59
00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:17.463
<i>an MMA fighter</i>

60
00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.432
{\an8}<i>with a strong understanding of boxing.</i>

61
00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:20.667
{\an8}KIM SANGWOOK
EX-UDT MMA FIGHTER

62
00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:23.670
I've fought him before.

63
00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:25.271
He's not an easy opponent at all.

64
00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:26.739
I could barely

65
00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.841
land any clean shots.

66
00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:32.679
<i>Cho Hyunjae's strengths are</i>
<i>his polished technique,</i>

67
00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:37.083
<i>fast footwork, sharp ring IQ, and speed.</i>

68
00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.351
[participant] All right!

69
00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:40.320
Your game plan has to be pressure.

70
00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:42.522
You've got to come in big
and just stick to him.

71
00:03:42.589 --> 00:03:44.424
Keep it short and constant.

72
00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:47.126
From here,
he's probably gonna try to escape.

73
00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:48.294
Then you stay on him.

74
00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:49.829
Say he slides to the side.

75
00:03:49.896 --> 00:03:50.897
That's it.

76
00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:53.132
You have to keep it ugly.

77
00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:55.568
He's a competitive boxer,

78
00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:58.171
so if you try to fight clean,
you'll never win.

79
00:03:58.238 --> 00:04:00.540
You have to stay on him and wear him down.

80
00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:02.208
[Junseo] <i>This time,</i>

81
00:04:02.675 --> 00:04:04.711
<i>I'll step in first, run the fight…</i>

82
00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:09.916
<i>and I'll make it ugly</i>
<i>to the point it feels excessive.</i>

83
00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.186
YUK JUNSEO

84
00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:15.755
<i>The plan is to drag him into a mud fight</i>

85
00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:19.259
and try to take the win.

86
00:04:19.325 --> 00:04:21.995
I'll admit Yuk Junseo is strong.

87
00:04:23.229 --> 00:04:24.731
How's Yuk Junseo? He good?

88
00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:26.499
Just raw power.

89
00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:28.701
So how do you deal with that?
When he throws,

90
00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:29.869
back up quick, then ba-bam!

91
00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:31.904
Punch like this. Pow!

92
00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:33.206
Bam! Just like this.

93
00:04:34.407 --> 00:04:37.543
I'll use my speed and conditioning

94
00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.245
<i>to keep moving,</i>

95
00:04:39.312 --> 00:04:41.080
<i>draw him in with feints,</i>

96
00:04:41.681 --> 00:04:43.750
<i>drain his stamina as much as possible,</i>

97
00:04:43.816 --> 00:04:46.119
<i>and stay in control of the fight.</i>

98
00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:48.054
{\an8}CHO HYUNJAE

99
00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.891
[Junseo] <i>Whether someone's a pro or not…</i>

100
00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:54.494
<i>Background means nothing to me.</i>

101
00:04:59.132 --> 00:05:00.900
<i>Boxer to boxer,</i>

102
00:05:01.534 --> 00:05:03.636
<i>I'm focused only on my opponent.</i>

103
00:05:05.938 --> 00:05:08.508
[Hyunjae] <i>I've been boxing for 11 years.</i>

104
00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.846
<i>My boxing IQ is on a different level.</i>

105
00:05:15.281 --> 00:05:18.751
<i>I'll show that those years</i>
<i>of boxing weren't for nothing.</i>

106
00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:23.823
EPISODE 8

107
00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:26.659
[spectators] Let's go!

108
00:05:27.827 --> 00:05:29.629
{\an8}- He just needs to stay calm.
- What?

109
00:05:29.696 --> 00:05:31.130
{\an8}He needs to stay calm.

110
00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:33.232
{\an8}This is gonna break
my mom's heart. [laughs]

111
00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:34.367
{\an8}YUK JUNSEO'S BROTHER

112
00:05:34.434 --> 00:05:37.270
Bell rings, you keep the lead hand active.

113
00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:39.539
{\an8}Throw some feints
and see how he comes in, okay?

114
00:05:39.605 --> 00:05:42.108
Wait, the fringe is gonna cause friction.

115
00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:44.444
Who knows what'll happen? You never know.

116
00:05:45.011 --> 00:05:46.779
Cho Hyunjae's got great technique.

117
00:05:46.846 --> 00:05:49.182
The question is
how effective Junseo's pressure will be.

118
00:05:49.248 --> 00:05:51.317
- If he sneaks one in… Yeah.
- That could be trouble.

119
00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:53.786
Hyunjae might get shaken by that.

120
00:05:53.853 --> 00:05:56.356
- Exactly. That's how you lose your rhythm.
- He might.

121
00:05:56.923 --> 00:05:58.591
The quarterfinals of<i> I Am Boxer</i>.

122
00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:02.495
Let the fight begin!

123
00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:07.033
Let's go, Yuk Junseo!

124
00:06:08.935 --> 00:06:10.737
{\an8}- Box!
- [bell chimes]

125
00:06:10.803 --> 00:06:12.772
{\an8}[Seungheon] The first round has begun.

126
00:06:13.339 --> 00:06:14.907
{\an8}YUK JUNSEO X CHO HYUNJAE

127
00:06:14.974 --> 00:06:17.477
{\an8}Cho Hyunjae starts with light punches.

128
00:06:17.543 --> 00:06:19.479
Nice shot from Yuk Junseo!

129
00:06:19.545 --> 00:06:20.880
- There it is.
- See that?

130
00:06:20.947 --> 00:06:22.749
You can't avoid every punch.

131
00:06:25.084 --> 00:06:28.020
[Junseo] <i>I threw a jab pretty early on,</i>
<i>and he got hit.</i>

132
00:06:28.588 --> 00:06:30.656
<i>That's when I realized,</i>

133
00:06:31.591 --> 00:06:33.559
<i>it might not be impossible after all.</i>

134
00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:35.661
[spectators exclaim]

135
00:06:36.963 --> 00:06:41.167
[Seungheon] He landed a heavy straight
with that lead hand.

136
00:06:44.303 --> 00:06:46.339
[Lee] I bet Cho Hyunjae's
feeling the weight.

137
00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:48.641
[Jongkook] He's probably never felt
shots like that before.

138
00:06:48.708 --> 00:06:50.410
[Dex] Right, he throws with raw power.

139
00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.945
- It's all instinct, you know.
- Stop.

140
00:06:55.615 --> 00:06:56.816
[brother] Hyunjae, use your footwork.

141
00:06:57.583 --> 00:06:58.684
No holding.

142
00:06:58.751 --> 00:07:00.720
[Hyunjae] <i>I was a bit caught off guard.</i>

143
00:07:00.787 --> 00:07:02.755
- [in English] Box!
- [♪ tense music playing]

144
00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:05.625
[Hyunjae] <i>I'd fought him before,</i>
<i>so I thought I had a read on his style,</i>

145
00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:09.629
<i>but he opened</i>
<i>with a completely different approach.</i>

146
00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:10.963
<i>That caught me off guard.</i>

147
00:07:12.532 --> 00:07:17.370
[Junseo] <i>I plan to be really aggressive</i>
<i>in the clinch.</i>

148
00:07:18.004 --> 00:07:20.373
That kind of grabbing
should really rattle him up.

149
00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.342
[spectator 1] Nice,
he's pretty tense right now!

150
00:07:24.243 --> 00:07:26.212
[spectator 2]
That's it! Trade shots like that!

151
00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.881
[Seungheon] Coming in, Yuk Junseo.

152
00:07:31.651 --> 00:07:32.885
- Nice!
- That's it!

153
00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.255
[spectator 3] All right! Doing good!

154
00:07:36.823 --> 00:07:38.491
All right! Doing good!

155
00:07:39.792 --> 00:07:41.060
[Lee] Counters like that.

156
00:07:41.961 --> 00:07:44.230
- They're big if you walk into them.
- Exactly.

157
00:07:44.297 --> 00:07:45.331
Nice shot!

158
00:07:45.865 --> 00:07:46.866
[ref] Break it up!

159
00:07:50.203 --> 00:07:52.405
[Seungheon] Nice uppercut!
Right back with one to the face!

160
00:07:56.075 --> 00:07:57.844
[Gyuwon] After Yuk Junseo
took that one shot,

161
00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.378
he's struggling to find his range.

162
00:07:59.445 --> 00:08:01.581
That's right!
And that's when you need composure.

163
00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:05.685
[spectator] Yes, a big left!

164
00:08:05.751 --> 00:08:07.086
Ah…

165
00:08:09.088 --> 00:08:10.122
[judges groan]

166
00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.124
[Lee] He took a big shot there.

167
00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:13.659
- [coach] Guard up!
- That's right!

168
00:08:13.726 --> 00:08:15.862
[Seungheon]
Yuk's holding his own right now!

169
00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.298
{\an8}- Let's go!
- Let's go!

170
00:08:19.365 --> 00:08:21.067
{\an8}- Guard up, man!
- Ten seconds!

171
00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:23.636
{\an8}Round's almost done! It's almost over!

172
00:08:23.703 --> 00:08:25.071
Don't forget to breathe!

173
00:08:25.771 --> 00:08:26.873
{\an8}[spectator] Stay on him!

174
00:08:29.575 --> 00:08:31.177
{\an8}- [bell rings]
- [in English] Stop!

175
00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:33.346
[Seungheon]
That's the end of the first round.

176
00:08:35.248 --> 00:08:36.649
[spectator] You got this!

177
00:08:36.716 --> 00:08:39.519
[Seungheon] Cho Hyunjae showed us
some fantastic footwork there.

178
00:08:39.585 --> 00:08:42.188
We didn't get to see
too many of those, though.

179
00:08:42.255 --> 00:08:45.791
But we definitely got a good look at
what kind of talent Yuk Junseo has.

180
00:08:45.858 --> 00:08:47.093
That was the first round.

181
00:08:47.593 --> 00:08:49.629
Cho Hyunjae looked a bit rattled early on,

182
00:08:49.695 --> 00:08:52.398
but toward the end,
he seemed to have found his rhythm.

183
00:08:52.465 --> 00:08:55.368
Those uppercuts came in, "bam, bam, bam."

184
00:08:55.434 --> 00:08:57.503
- And they all landed clean.
- Right.

185
00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.039
- [spectator 1] That's it!
- [spectator 2] Guard up, guard up!

186
00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:02.041
[spectator] Yes, a big left!

187
00:09:03.309 --> 00:09:06.412
Breaking Hyunjae down
might be tougher than expected.

188
00:09:06.479 --> 00:09:09.916
At this point, you're just hoping
one big shot gets through.

189
00:09:09.982 --> 00:09:11.617
You're doing awesome, man.

190
00:09:11.684 --> 00:09:12.685
Awesome.

191
00:09:12.752 --> 00:09:14.353
You're not flustered. He is.

192
00:09:15.087 --> 00:09:16.989
But just keep one thing in mind.

193
00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:18.090
Keep the left hand up.

194
00:09:18.157 --> 00:09:19.892
You keep dropping it and getting hit here.

195
00:09:19.959 --> 00:09:22.461
You've actually got
better straights than him.

196
00:09:23.663 --> 00:09:25.164
Good job. You did good, but--

197
00:09:25.231 --> 00:09:27.767
- I'm tensing up?
- Yeah, you can't tense up too much.

198
00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:29.335
And always connect it to the left.

199
00:09:29.402 --> 00:09:31.470
He's eating them all up right now.

200
00:09:31.537 --> 00:09:34.106
Just do your thing.
Clean and sharp, pop-pop.

201
00:09:34.173 --> 00:09:35.675
- Try it like that.
- Nice and easy?

202
00:09:35.741 --> 00:09:36.943
Yeah, nice and easy.

203
00:09:39.145 --> 00:09:40.146
Let's go, Hyunjae!

204
00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:42.648
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

205
00:09:43.849 --> 00:09:45.785
{\an8}[Seungheon] Let's see how
the second round unfolds.

206
00:09:46.686 --> 00:09:47.954
{\an8}YUK JUNSEO X CHO HYUNJAE

207
00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.021
{\an8}- [in English] Box!
- [bell chimes]

208
00:09:50.423 --> 00:09:51.624
{\an8}[spectator, in Korean] Let's go!

209
00:09:51.691 --> 00:09:53.125
{\an8}Good start with the left.

210
00:09:53.926 --> 00:09:54.927
Keep that left coming!

211
00:09:55.561 --> 00:09:56.929
[Jongkook] Yes, he has to go for it.

212
00:09:56.996 --> 00:09:58.664
- [spectator] Come on, pop-pop!
- That's it!

213
00:10:00.967 --> 00:10:03.936
[Seungheon] Cho's finding his rhythm,
slowly stepping inside.

214
00:10:04.003 --> 00:10:06.439
[spectator] Keep moving! Don't stop!

215
00:10:06.505 --> 00:10:08.441
Right hook! Go, go!

216
00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:11.744
That's super scary. His right hand.

217
00:10:12.878 --> 00:10:14.747
[Lee] He's getting figured out now.

218
00:10:14.814 --> 00:10:16.882
His straights are getting read.

219
00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:20.086
[Hyunjae] I felt like I had a slight edge,
so from then on,

220
00:10:20.152 --> 00:10:22.021
I knew it was my pace.

221
00:10:22.521 --> 00:10:23.723
[spectator] Okay, nice!

222
00:10:23.789 --> 00:10:26.692
[Seungheon] Cho drops the guard
and uses his upper body to slip away!

223
00:10:27.193 --> 00:10:29.095
- Guard up!
- Guard up!

224
00:10:29.895 --> 00:10:32.498
- Your footwork! Go now!
- [Hyunjae] <i>I wanted to fight smart,</i>

225
00:10:32.565 --> 00:10:33.899
<i>so I dropped my guard</i>

226
00:10:33.966 --> 00:10:36.469
<i>and tried to make it my kind of fight.</i>

227
00:10:36.936 --> 00:10:38.704
[Dex] Now you've gotta fight on instinct.

228
00:10:44.744 --> 00:10:45.745
[spectators] All right!

229
00:10:45.811 --> 00:10:48.180
[Gyuwon] That cross-upper-cross
was wonderful!

230
00:10:49.615 --> 00:10:50.616
[spectator] Slip it all the way!

231
00:10:51.183 --> 00:10:54.153
[Dex] You can really see the difference
an elite boxer makes.

232
