468
00:22:27.713 --> 00:22:29.614
Hey, stay focused!

469
00:22:30.515 --> 00:22:33.552
Yuk fires, but Cho slips it easily.

470
00:22:34.386 --> 00:22:36.221
Yuk Junseo closes in on him!

471
00:22:37.122 --> 00:22:39.224
Cho works the ropes,
shifting side to side.

472
00:22:39.291 --> 00:22:41.193
But even in tight quarters, he slips.

473
00:22:41.860 --> 00:22:43.261
Play with him! Yes!

474
00:22:44.563 --> 00:22:46.398
Once Hyunjae gets rolling,

475
00:22:46.965 --> 00:22:47.966
nobody can stop him.

476
00:22:53.772 --> 00:22:55.607
I think he's about to do something now.

477
00:22:55.674 --> 00:22:56.708
Took him long enough.

478
00:23:02.147 --> 00:23:03.482
Step forward!

479
00:23:03.548 --> 00:23:04.583
Go to the body first!

480
00:23:20.098 --> 00:23:22.901
Look at that unpredictable explosiveness!

481
00:23:23.468 --> 00:23:25.537
Cho Hyunjae won't like that at all.

482
00:23:25.604 --> 00:23:26.938
They usually come in like this,

483
00:23:27.005 --> 00:23:28.240
- but he throws like this.
- Yes.

484
00:23:28.306 --> 00:23:29.975
- It's confusing the poor boy.
- Exactly.

485
00:23:31.777 --> 00:23:33.311
Go again, work the body first!

486
00:23:33.879 --> 00:23:39.251
<i>My punches were starting to land</i>
<i>on Hyunjae's face.</i>

487
00:23:40.352 --> 00:23:43.188
<i>That gave me a sliver of hope.</i>

488
00:23:43.255 --> 00:23:46.758
<i>So I tried to put real impact</i>
<i>into every shot.</i>

489
00:23:49.494 --> 00:23:50.662
Hyunjae, right hand!

490
00:23:53.131 --> 00:23:56.501
That hunter instinct
is still alive in Yuk Junseo!

491
00:23:57.969 --> 00:24:01.406
- He's fighting on a one-percent chance.
- That's right.

492
00:24:01.473 --> 00:24:03.375
- And that one percent hit. It's insane.
- It did.

493
00:24:04.709 --> 00:24:06.778
But Cho Hyunjae fires right back!

494
00:24:08.113 --> 00:24:09.114
Don't give up!

495
00:24:09.748 --> 00:24:10.782
That body shot landed!

496
00:24:10.849 --> 00:24:12.717
- That went in hard. He felt that.
- That landed.

497
00:24:12.784 --> 00:24:14.252
That one sank in hard.

498
00:24:14.319 --> 00:24:16.621
Hyunjae knows that too.

499
00:24:18.356 --> 00:24:20.125
Another body shot connected.

500
00:24:20.192 --> 00:24:21.960
Yeah, he's really feeling it.

501
00:24:22.027 --> 00:24:23.929
Right, he's doubled over.

502
00:24:24.629 --> 00:24:26.131
{\an8}Another body shot! He's doubling over!

503
00:24:26.198 --> 00:24:28.834
{\an8}The round's almost over,
and there have been dangerous body shots!

504
00:24:28.900 --> 00:24:31.236
{\an8}You know you caught him, punk!
You caught him!

505
00:24:31.303 --> 00:24:32.938
{\an8}Grab and hold! Hang in there!

506
00:24:38.877 --> 00:24:41.179
It's Cho Hyunjae's technique
versus Yuk Junseo's raw grit!

507
00:24:41.246 --> 00:24:42.781
Now this is boxing.

508
00:24:47.185 --> 00:24:48.520
Come over here.

509
00:24:50.455 --> 00:24:51.523
Bring his chair over.

510
00:24:57.662 --> 00:25:00.131
- That's really impressive.
- Right?

511
00:25:00.198 --> 00:25:02.100
His grit's something else.

512
00:25:02.167 --> 00:25:04.369
I don't even know anymore.
I'm cheering for both.

513
00:25:04.836 --> 00:25:06.771
If it gets rough,
clinch up and ride it out.

514
00:25:06.838 --> 00:25:08.640
That's it. You're doing great.

515
00:25:10.108 --> 00:25:11.676
It's the last round.

516
00:25:14.913 --> 00:25:16.781
<i>With it being the final round,</i>

517
00:25:16.848 --> 00:25:20.018
<i>giving up is not an option.</i>

518
00:25:20.085 --> 00:25:22.888
<i>I'll give it everything I've got in there.</i>

519
00:25:27.192 --> 00:25:30.161
<i>Now there's only the final round left.</i>

520
00:25:31.463 --> 00:25:32.797
<i>I've come this far.</i>

521
00:25:33.398 --> 00:25:35.033
<i>There's no turning back now.</i>

522
00:25:35.100 --> 00:25:37.536
<i>I'll fight to the end and take the title.</i>

523
00:25:37.602 --> 00:25:38.837
Keep it up.

524
00:25:38.904 --> 00:25:40.472
You're doing very well.

525
00:25:44.009 --> 00:25:45.610
We're heading into the final round.

526
00:25:46.144 --> 00:25:47.312
Let's go, Hyunjae!

527
00:25:49.981 --> 00:25:52.317
- You got this, Junseo!
- Let's go, bro!

528
00:25:57.389 --> 00:26:00.025
{\an8}Round 6 has now begun.

529
00:26:00.091 --> 00:26:02.294
{\an8}YUK JUNSEO X CHO HYUNJAE

530
00:26:03.395 --> 00:26:04.663
{\an8}Keep your left hand up!

531
00:26:08.633 --> 00:26:11.236
Yuk's taken the center,
hunting for the counter.

532
00:26:11.303 --> 00:26:13.505
Junseo, step back! Step back, then fire!

533
00:26:14.005 --> 00:26:15.273
Awesome!

534
00:26:17.976 --> 00:26:19.611
Man, he took a lot of shots there.

535
00:26:23.915 --> 00:26:27.252
<i>I clearly felt some of my jabs</i>
<i>landing clean,</i>

536
00:26:27.319 --> 00:26:29.955
<i>but Yuk Junseo was enduring on sheer will.</i>

537
00:26:30.021 --> 00:26:32.924
<i>That's what got me going on and on.</i>

538
00:26:34.759 --> 00:26:35.760
That's it!

539
00:26:36.761 --> 00:26:37.762
Stop!

540
00:26:38.797 --> 00:26:41.433
Man, that's gotta be real tough.

541
00:26:41.499 --> 00:26:44.302
If you lean forward and get pressed down,
you drain fast.

542
00:26:45.503 --> 00:26:47.439
Deep breaths! Focus!

543
00:26:48.239 --> 00:26:49.240
Box!

544
00:26:49.307 --> 00:26:53.144
Yuk Junseo's stamina appears nearly gone,

545
00:26:53.211 --> 00:26:54.679
but he's still holding on.

546
00:26:54.746 --> 00:26:56.548
He's literally gasping for breath,

547
00:26:56.615 --> 00:26:58.183
but he's still got fire in his eyes.

548
00:26:58.683 --> 00:26:59.818
Let's go, Junseo!

549
00:27:01.353 --> 00:27:03.822
Junseo needs to keep his guard up.

550
00:27:04.689 --> 00:27:07.492
Cho Hyunjae's footwork is picking up now.

551
00:27:09.995 --> 00:27:11.262
A body combo!

552
00:27:13.131 --> 00:27:15.567
- That went in!
- That looks painful!

553
00:27:19.004 --> 00:27:21.106
<i>His body shots</i>
<i>were definitely threatening.</i>

554
00:27:21.172 --> 00:27:23.141
<i>I tried to endure on willpower,</i>

555
00:27:23.208 --> 00:27:26.244
<i>but one wrong move</i>
<i>could've led to a knockdown.</i>

556
00:27:26.811 --> 00:27:28.947
The damage is adding up, so he clinches.

557
00:27:33.218 --> 00:27:35.086
It's gotta be absolutely exhausting.

558
00:27:38.657 --> 00:27:39.991
Yuk's still in it!

559
00:27:40.058 --> 00:27:41.393
Still throwing lethal punches!

560
00:27:44.295 --> 00:27:48.133
Meanwhile, Cho Hyunjae is doing everything
to finish this with his own hands.

561
00:27:48.199 --> 00:27:50.168
I don't know how he's even standing.

562
00:27:50.235 --> 00:27:51.336
He's amazing.

563
00:27:53.405 --> 00:27:55.940
I won't say the thought of giving up
never crossed my mind.

564
00:27:56.474 --> 00:27:58.910
But once you give in,

565
00:27:58.977 --> 00:28:02.213
it's what comes after that's terrifying.

566
00:28:04.282 --> 00:28:06.217
<i>I didn't want to get knocked out,</i>

567
00:28:06.284 --> 00:28:11.022
<i>or have my corner throw in the towel.</i>

568
00:28:11.089 --> 00:28:13.458
<i>I wanted to see the fight</i>
<i>through to the end.</i>

569
00:28:14.759 --> 00:28:16.261
Yuk Junseo is barely hanging on!

570
00:28:16.327 --> 00:28:18.430
But still, he refuses to give up!

571
00:28:20.198 --> 00:28:21.299
You got this!

572
00:28:21.900 --> 00:28:23.001
Let's go, Hyunjae!

573
00:28:23.868 --> 00:28:26.137
Last push! This is it!

574
00:28:26.705 --> 00:28:28.540
Thirty seconds! Let's go!

575
00:28:28.606 --> 00:28:29.674
Time's running out!

576
00:28:36.848 --> 00:28:38.583
Yuk took that shot just now!

577
00:28:38.650 --> 00:28:40.452
Yuk Junseo's body buckles again!

578
00:28:40.518 --> 00:28:41.720
He's struggling there!

579
00:28:42.520 --> 00:28:43.855
Hang in there!

580
00:28:43.922 --> 00:28:44.923
Stay sharp!

581
00:28:47.025 --> 00:28:48.727
{\an8}Fire those combos!

582
00:28:48.793 --> 00:28:49.994
{\an8}You have to go now!

583
00:28:50.495 --> 00:28:52.063
{\an8}Junseo, one last push!

584
00:28:56.668 --> 00:29:00.105
{\an8}And that brings the fight to an end!

585
00:29:00.171 --> 00:29:02.040
Yuk Junseo versus Cho Hyunjae!

586
00:29:02.741 --> 00:29:04.309
Those final 10 seconds

587
00:29:04.375 --> 00:29:06.578
were pure intensity!

588
00:29:06.644 --> 00:29:08.913
Boxing is a fight against yourself.

589
00:29:08.980 --> 00:29:12.684
Both fighters showed incredible grit
all the way to the end!

590
00:29:16.387 --> 00:29:18.389
- You did awesome, bro!
- Amazing!

591
00:29:19.157 --> 00:29:21.693
Wow, that deserves real respect.

592
00:29:22.227 --> 00:29:23.561
That was unreal.

593
00:29:25.029 --> 00:29:27.198
- How do you even survive that?
- That was good.

594
00:29:27.265 --> 00:29:28.533
That was insane.

595
00:29:28.600 --> 00:29:29.667
Well fought.

596
00:29:32.470 --> 00:29:37.342
For the record,
Yuk Junseo is my UDT senior.

597
00:29:37.408 --> 00:29:40.945
A lot of people ask
who would win if we fought.

598
00:29:41.012 --> 00:29:42.347
After seeing this today,

599
00:29:42.413 --> 00:29:44.249
I think I'd lose.

600
00:29:44.315 --> 00:29:46.017
Honestly, I mean it.

601
00:29:46.084 --> 00:29:49.587
I don't think that's even debatable.

602
00:29:49.654 --> 00:29:51.189
You're amazing, man!

603
00:29:51.756 --> 00:29:53.558
- That was fun, huh?
- So much fun.

604
00:29:54.659 --> 00:29:56.561
{\an8}We will now announce the result.

605
00:29:57.362 --> 00:29:58.396
I wonder who'll win?

606
00:30:02.700 --> 00:30:03.701
What now?

607
00:30:04.435 --> 00:30:05.603
I can't look.

608
00:30:06.237 --> 00:30:07.338
[♪ tense music plays]

609
00:30:07.872 --> 00:30:09.941
[Jongkook] Judge one scores it for…

610
00:30:11.442 --> 00:30:15.246
<i>Among all the fighters I've faced so far,</i>

611
00:30:15.313 --> 00:30:18.449
<i>Yuk Junseo had the hardest punches</i>
<i>and was the toughest to deal with.</i>

612
00:30:18.516 --> 00:30:21.319
<i>Until the hand goes up, nothing's decided.</i>

613
00:30:25.490 --> 00:30:28.426
[Junseo] <i>It doesn't matter whether</i>
<i>I'm a pro or how long I've trained.</i>

614
00:30:28.493 --> 00:30:30.895
<i>What matters is</i>
<i>how you perform in that ring.</i>

615
00:30:30.962 --> 00:30:33.765
<i>I stepped in fully determined to win.</i>

616
00:30:36.067 --> 00:30:37.602
{\an8}[Jongkook] Cho Hyunjae in the blue corner.

617
00:30:37.669 --> 00:30:39.370
{\an8}JUDGE 1
BLUE CORNER CHO HYUNJAE WINS

618
00:30:44.008 --> 00:30:46.411
[Dex] Judge two scores it for…

619
00:30:46.477 --> 00:30:48.479
[♪ tense music playing]

620
00:30:55.954 --> 00:30:57.789
{\an8}Cho Hyunjae in the blue corner!

621
00:30:58.289 --> 00:31:00.124
{\an8}Cho Hyunjae in the blue corner!

622
00:31:00.625 --> 00:31:04.896
{\an8}[Lee] The winner is Cho Hyunjae
in the blue corner.

623
00:31:04.963 --> 00:31:07.131
{\an8}BLUE CORNER CHO HYUNJAE
ADVANCES TO THE SEMIFINALS

624
00:31:07.198 --> 00:31:08.666
[♪ soft music plays]

625
00:31:08.733 --> 00:31:09.968
[crowd clapping]

626
00:31:15.573 --> 00:31:16.574
First off…

627
00:31:17.075 --> 00:31:19.477
I took a solid shot,
so my head's still spinning.

628
00:31:20.044 --> 00:31:23.314
But I'd like share the joy of this win
with everyone who supported me,

629
00:31:23.381 --> 00:31:26.351
and with the people I love. Thank you.

630
00:31:26.417 --> 00:31:27.585
[crowd cheering]

631
00:31:32.423 --> 00:31:34.259
[Dex] All right, moving on to Yuk Junseo.

632
00:31:34.325 --> 00:31:37.028
You showed incredible grit,
but you have now been eliminated.

633
00:31:37.095 --> 00:31:38.730
Please share your final thoughts.

634
00:31:39.197 --> 00:31:41.299
I stepped into this ring
fully intending to win.

635
00:31:41.799 --> 00:31:45.436
Ultimately, I think I lost to the years
Cho Hyunjae has devoted to this.

636
00:31:46.070 --> 00:31:47.972
That was beyond what I could match.

637
00:31:48.039 --> 00:31:49.140
I truly wish him…

638
00:31:49.207 --> 00:31:50.208
[♪ gentle music plays]

639
00:31:50.275 --> 00:31:51.910
…the best going forward.

640
00:31:51.976 --> 00:31:54.479
I think my mother can finally
breathe a sigh of relief now.

641
00:31:54.545 --> 00:31:57.916
She's always been worried
about me getting into boxing.

642
00:31:57.982 --> 00:32:01.319
From my time in the military
up to this moment today,

643
00:32:01.386 --> 00:32:02.954
whenever I felt suffocated

644
00:32:03.021 --> 00:32:05.423
or completely exhausted,
I always thought of my mother.

645
00:32:05.490 --> 00:32:07.458
This reminded me of that again. Thank you.

646
00:32:08.526 --> 00:32:10.261
[crowd cheering]

647
00:32:15.900 --> 00:32:19.337
All I'm left with are really fun,
meaningful memories.

648
00:32:19.404 --> 00:32:22.206
I now know that deciding to box

649
00:32:22.774 --> 00:32:24.842
was absolutely the right decision.

650
00:32:26.244 --> 00:32:27.445
[spectator] You're awesome!

651
00:32:27.512 --> 00:32:30.648
[Junseo] <i>The experiences I've gained here</i>
<i>on </i>I Am Boxer

652
00:32:31.616 --> 00:32:33.751
<i>will provide invaluable guidance</i>

653
00:32:34.619 --> 00:32:36.387
for my life going forward.

654
00:32:38.489 --> 00:32:40.124
Why? What's wrong?

655
00:32:40.191 --> 00:32:41.559
That was tough, huh?

656
00:32:42.226 --> 00:32:43.661
How was the match?

657
00:32:44.963 --> 00:32:47.432
Why? Because you could've done better?

658
00:32:48.099 --> 00:32:49.100
Is that it?

659
00:32:50.601 --> 00:32:53.171
- It's okay. You did wonderfully.
- [crying]

660
00:32:54.739 --> 00:32:55.840
Was it tough?

661
00:32:57.675 --> 00:32:58.676
[parent chuckles]

662
00:32:59.210 --> 00:33:00.945
[Hyunjae] <i>When I fell into my mom's arms,</i>

663
00:33:01.012 --> 00:33:03.414
<i>she held me, saying I'd done well.</i>

664
00:33:03.948 --> 00:33:05.783
She must've been scared the whole match.

665
00:33:06.617 --> 00:33:08.152
I felt bad about that.

666
00:33:10.955 --> 00:33:12.557
- Don't tell Dad about this.
- [chuckles]

667
00:33:13.191 --> 00:33:14.325
Okay, I won't tell him.

668
00:33:15.193 --> 00:33:18.830
I'm embarrassed I couldn't do better
in front of you, Mom.

669
00:33:18.896 --> 00:33:19.998
Next time you're here,

670
00:33:20.631 --> 00:33:23.501
I'll show you I can be better.
Thank you for everything.

671
00:33:24.802 --> 00:33:27.205
How was it, everyone?
Did you enjoy the fight?

672
00:33:27.271 --> 00:33:28.539
- Yes!
- Yes!

673
00:33:29.140 --> 00:33:30.942
[fan 1] Love you, Don!

674
00:33:32.577 --> 00:33:33.578
Sorry?

675
00:33:33.644 --> 00:33:35.246
You're the best, Don!

676
00:33:35.313 --> 00:33:36.581
[crowd cheers]

677
00:33:36.647 --> 00:33:37.782
[fan 2] You're so cool!

678
00:33:38.683 --> 00:33:40.118
[whimsical music plays]

679
00:33:48.760 --> 00:33:49.761
That's his trademark.

680
00:33:49.827 --> 00:33:52.130
I bet that means,
"I'll crack your skull open."

681
00:33:53.231 --> 00:33:54.766
[Lee] The quarterfinals of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

682
00:33:55.800 --> 00:33:57.735
Let the third bout begin.

683
00:34:03.841 --> 00:34:05.343
[tense music plays]

684
00:34:10.314 --> 00:34:15.820
[Dex] Entering from the blue corner,
Striker, Lee Gijun!

685
00:34:27.765 --> 00:34:31.903
{\an8}LEE GIJUN'S FRIENDS

686
00:34:32.904 --> 00:34:34.372
[crowd cheering]

687
00:34:43.748 --> 00:34:46.818
[in English] My man! My man! [chuckles]

688
00:34:47.285 --> 00:34:49.087
"My man! My man!"

689
00:34:49.153 --> 00:34:50.154
"My man." [chuckles]

690
00:34:51.856 --> 00:34:54.158
[exciting music plays]

691
00:34:55.526 --> 00:34:57.528
[crowd cheers]

692
00:35:05.570 --> 00:35:06.737
[Gijun] <i>As soon as I went up there,</i>

693
00:35:07.472 --> 00:35:10.174
<i>I could hear the roar of the crowd,</i>
<i>which felt great.</i>

694
00:35:11.109 --> 00:35:14.245
<i>I knew then, "This is finally my chance."</i>

695
00:35:14.312 --> 00:35:16.380
"It's time to prove myself on stage."

696
00:35:16.447 --> 00:35:17.615
I'm super excited.

697
00:35:19.517 --> 00:35:21.986
<i>I'd wanted to box</i>
<i>ever since middle school.</i>

698
00:35:22.053 --> 00:35:24.655
<i>Boxing was the only thing</i>
<i>I truly wanted to do.</i>

699
00:35:27.658 --> 00:35:30.728
<i>But my biological mother</i>
<i>was against it at the time.</i>

700
00:35:30.795 --> 00:35:33.464
<i>I really wanted to try,</i>
<i>but they just wouldn't let me.</i>

701
00:35:33.531 --> 00:35:35.133
So I asked my parents again,

702
00:35:35.199 --> 00:35:37.568
thinking it would be better
to learn boxing

703
00:35:37.635 --> 00:35:40.605
than to waste time doing nothing.

704
00:35:41.405 --> 00:35:42.707
That's how I got into boxing.

705
00:35:43.174 --> 00:35:44.375
<i>It's been four years now.</i>

706
00:35:45.343 --> 00:35:48.246
<i>I currently train at Woosuk University.</i>

707
00:35:50.448 --> 00:35:55.520
I'll show you the kind of boxing match
you don't usually see in Korea.

708
00:35:56.521 --> 00:36:00.091
[Jongkook] The fighter facing Lee Gijun
will now enter.

709
00:36:07.665 --> 00:36:09.300
Entering from the red corner…

710
00:36:09.367 --> 00:36:10.635
[hip-hop music plays]

711
00:36:10.701 --> 00:36:12.737
Prince, Lee Chaehyun!

712
00:36:21.279 --> 00:36:23.314
[crowd cheering]

713
00:36:25.816 --> 00:36:28.986
{\an8}- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Come on, let's go!

714
00:36:32.023 --> 00:36:33.991
[cheering continues]

715
00:36:53.844 --> 00:36:54.912
[spectator] Let's go, go!

716
00:36:58.783 --> 00:37:00.251
[Chaehyun] <i>Losing is not an option.</i>

717
00:37:00.318 --> 00:37:01.519
<i>I will win, no matter what.</i>

718
00:37:02.253 --> 00:37:04.855
As an athlete training with the KAFAC,

719
00:37:04.922 --> 00:37:06.390
I'm here to win.

720
00:37:07.091 --> 00:37:09.126
KOREA ARMED FORCES ATHLETIC CORPS

721
00:37:09.927 --> 00:37:12.063
<i>My name is Lee Chaehyun,</i>

722
00:37:12.129 --> 00:37:13.564
<i>and I'm with the KAFAC.</i>

723
00:37:16.400 --> 00:37:18.736
- <i>Because of the intense training…</i>
- [both grunting]

724
00:37:18.803 --> 00:37:20.504
<i>…I go through in the military,</i>

725
00:37:22.406 --> 00:37:25.643
- <i>I want to showcase my mental toughness…</i>
- [grunting]

726
00:37:25.710 --> 00:37:27.545
<i>…and physical endurance in this match.</i>

727
00:37:29.247 --> 00:37:32.516
- Man, today's workout was brutal.
- Seriously, it was intense.

728
00:37:32.583 --> 00:37:33.818
Let's perk up with this.

729
00:37:38.055 --> 00:37:39.724
- This tastes good.
- It's sugar-free.

730
00:37:39.790 --> 00:37:40.858
[Chaehyun] For real?

731
00:37:41.792 --> 00:37:44.362
- Quarterfinals, here we come.
- You got it.

732
00:37:47.798 --> 00:37:50.568
[Chaehyun] <i>After making it this far,</i>
<i>I hate the thought of losing.</i>

733
00:37:51.469 --> 00:37:53.738
Without boxing,

734
00:37:53.804 --> 00:37:55.840
I wouldn't be where I am.

735
00:37:55.906 --> 00:37:59.677
Boxing is… everything to me.

736
00:37:59.744 --> 00:38:01.245
It's my life.

737
00:38:01.312 --> 00:38:03.047
It really is my whole life.

738
00:38:04.415 --> 00:38:05.816
<i>With a do-or-die mind-set,</i>

739
00:38:05.883 --> 00:38:08.486
<i>I'll win, even if it kills me.</i>

740
00:38:11.822 --> 00:38:12.857
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X LEE GIJUN

741
00:38:17.094 --> 00:38:19.530
These two are a great match physically.

742
00:38:19.597 --> 00:38:20.831
- Right?
- Real great.

743
00:38:20.898 --> 00:38:22.099
They're evenly matched.

744
00:38:22.967 --> 00:38:25.503
[announcer] <i>In the blue corner,</i>
<i>wearing the blue trunks.</i>

745
00:38:25.569 --> 00:38:28.072
<i>Standing 174 cm tall,</i>

746
00:38:28.139 --> 00:38:30.074
<i>weighing in at 72 kg.</i>

747
00:38:30.641 --> 00:38:33.277
<i>He is a fighter who hails from Ghana!</i>

748
00:38:33.344 --> 00:38:35.579
<i>Representing</i>
<i>the Woosuk University boxing team,</i>

749
00:38:35.646 --> 00:38:37.515
<i>he's one</i>
<i>with a frightening sense of rhythm!</i>

750
00:38:37.581 --> 00:38:39.583
<i>Please give it up for Striker!</i>

751
00:38:40.051 --> 00:38:44.488
{\an8}<i>Lee Gijun!</i>

752
00:38:44.555 --> 00:38:46.090
{\an8}LEE GIJUN

753
00:38:48.192 --> 00:38:50.428
Let's go, Gijun!

754
00:38:50.494 --> 00:38:53.064
<i>In the red corner,</i>
<i>wearing the purple trunks.</i>

755
00:38:53.130 --> 00:38:55.599
<i>Standing 179 cm tall,</i>

756
00:38:55.666 --> 00:38:58.069
<i>weighing in at 72 kg.</i>

757
00:38:58.135 --> 00:39:00.671
<i>The 2024 Korean Boxing Association</i>
<i>President's Cup,</i>

758
00:39:00.738 --> 00:39:02.606
<i>welterweight gold medalist!</i>

759
00:39:02.673 --> 00:39:06.744
<i>As a member of the KAFAC,</i>
<i>he's the total package!</i>

760
00:39:06.811 --> 00:39:09.080
<i>The crown prince of the ring!</i>

761
00:39:09.146 --> 00:39:11.515
<i>Please give it up for Prince!</i>

762
00:39:11.582 --> 00:39:16.354
{\an8}<i>Lee Chaehyun!</i>

763
00:39:16.420 --> 00:39:17.555
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN

764
00:39:17.621 --> 00:39:19.690
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- You got this!

765
00:39:21.125 --> 00:39:24.729
[Jongkook] Before the matchup,
let's hear from both fighters.

766
00:39:25.363 --> 00:39:27.732
Gijun, you all geared up for tonight?

767
00:39:29.200 --> 00:39:32.570
But I don't think any of that
is going to work on me.

768
00:39:33.337 --> 00:39:34.972
[cheering]

769
00:39:37.241 --> 00:39:39.143
- That's the spirit!
- Well said, Son!

770
00:39:39.910 --> 00:39:42.113
Your ring name is "Prince," huh?

771
00:39:43.781 --> 00:39:46.650
Today, I'll send you home as a "Princess."

772
00:39:47.551 --> 00:39:49.387
[cheering]

773
00:39:49.453 --> 00:39:50.521
[chuckles]

774
00:39:52.089 --> 00:39:55.493
[Dex]
All right, fighters, prepare for the bout.

775
00:39:56.093 --> 00:40:00.331
Next up, the third quarterfinal bout,
Lee Chaehyun versus Lee Gijun.

776
00:40:00.798 --> 00:40:03.734
Lee Chaehyun is originally right-handed,

777
00:40:03.801 --> 00:40:05.369
but he switched to southpaw.

778
00:40:05.436 --> 00:40:08.873
The constant variation
between the lead and rear hand

779
00:40:08.939 --> 00:40:11.242
will make him
especially intriguing to watch.

780
00:40:11.308 --> 00:40:14.412
[Gyuwon] In terms of punching power,
Lee Chaehyun has a slight edge.

781
00:40:14.478 --> 00:40:16.547
Lee Gijun holds the advantage

782
00:40:16.614 --> 00:40:19.750
- in technique and rhythm.
- [Seungheon] That's right.

783
00:40:19.817 --> 00:40:22.987
He could be the one
to set a new standard for ring rhythm.

784
00:40:23.487 --> 00:40:27.024
He's physically gifted
and worth watching in so many ways.

785
00:40:27.625 --> 00:40:29.860
[Gyuwon]
That's why, in this matchup especially,

786
00:40:29.927 --> 00:40:33.431
winning the distance battle early
will be key.

787
00:40:34.698 --> 00:40:37.067
[Jongkook] Let the fight begin!

788
00:40:40.805 --> 00:40:42.840
{\an8}[Lee] All right, southpaw versus orthodox.

789
00:40:44.341 --> 00:40:45.342
[in English] Box!

790
00:40:45.409 --> 00:40:46.444
{\an8}[bell rings]

791
00:40:46.510 --> 00:40:49.246
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X LEE GIJUN

792
00:40:49.313 --> 00:40:50.848
{\an8}[Seungheon, in Korean]
And the first round begins.

793
00:40:52.616 --> 00:40:55.152
Right away,
Lee Chaehyun extends the right hand.

794
00:40:55.219 --> 00:40:57.388
- [Lee] Both guys are good.
- [Jongkook] Right.

795
00:40:58.255 --> 00:40:59.490
Okay, nice!

796
00:41:00.558 --> 00:41:02.493
[Gyuwon]
Lee Chaehyun stepping inside like that,

797
00:41:02.560 --> 00:41:05.696
it tells you he's looking
to slip and counter.

798
00:41:05.763 --> 00:41:08.899
[Chaehyun] <i>I tried to stay calm</i>
<i>and focus on controlling the distance.</i>

799
00:41:11.001 --> 00:41:12.169
You got this, Chaehyun!

800
00:41:14.371 --> 00:41:18.042
[Seungheon] They're trading slowly
with the lead hands.

801
00:41:20.744 --> 00:41:21.979
[Dex exclaims]

802
00:41:22.446 --> 00:41:24.448
This early distance battle's important.

803
00:41:24.915 --> 00:41:27.384
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun is trying
to establish his rhythm,

804
00:41:27.451 --> 00:41:29.053
while Lee Gijun is

805
00:41:29.119 --> 00:41:31.255
watching for openings within that rhythm.

806
00:41:34.625 --> 00:41:36.727
[Jongkook]
How do you even close that distance?

807
00:41:37.962 --> 00:41:40.264
[Seungheon]
Lee Chaehyun strikes with his lead hand.

808
00:41:42.333 --> 00:41:43.701
[spectator 1] His eyes are locked in.

809
00:41:47.805 --> 00:41:49.540
[spectator 2] Come on, you got this!

810
00:41:50.608 --> 00:41:52.309
[Seungheon]
Lee Chaehyun fires with his rear hand!

811
00:41:53.043 --> 00:41:57.147
[Gyuwon] That lead hand shot is what
got him that clean rear hand shot!

812
00:41:59.550 --> 00:42:03.754
When fighting a southpaw,
you have to take an extra step forward.

813
00:42:03.821 --> 00:42:05.155
They're farther out.

814
00:42:07.291 --> 00:42:09.426
{\an8}- Ten seconds!
- [Jongkook] First round's almost done.

815
00:42:10.594 --> 00:42:12.596
{\an8}[Lee] Gijun is clearly feeling things out.

816
00:42:13.097 --> 00:42:14.665
He's doing a proper feel-out.

817
00:42:15.633 --> 00:42:17.701
{\an8}[Seungheon] He targets the body once,
then comes back upstairs again.

818
00:42:17.768 --> 00:42:20.404
{\an8}- [bell rings]
- And that concludes the first round.

819
00:42:20.471 --> 00:42:23.741
[Gyuwon] The timing battle
between these two was fierce!

820
00:42:23.807 --> 00:42:27.344
Most of all,
it's a fierce battle for range and timing.

821
00:42:28.579 --> 00:42:31.582
[Dex] Gijun's not even sitting down.
Guess his tank's still full.

822
00:42:32.316 --> 00:42:34.051
{\an8}He throws that jab around a lot.

823
00:42:34.118 --> 00:42:35.452
When he does, you've gotta strike.

824
00:42:36.086 --> 00:42:38.389
[Gijun] <i>Due to Lee Chaehyun's speed,</i>

825
00:42:38.455 --> 00:42:41.225
<i>it wasn't easy</i>
<i>to get the proper distance down.</i>

826
00:42:43.294 --> 00:42:44.929
[Chaehyun] <i>I've got the speed.</i>

827
00:42:44.995 --> 00:42:47.565
<i>As long as I keep my range and angles,</i>
<i>I should be fine.</i>

828
00:42:48.132 --> 00:42:49.433
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
CHAEHYUN: 10, GIJUN: 9

829
00:42:49.500 --> 00:42:51.468
{\an8}- [whistle blows]
- Let's go, Lee Chaehyun!

830
00:42:52.136 --> 00:42:53.504
[crowd cheering]

831
00:42:54.405 --> 00:42:55.706
[spectator] Let's go!

832
00:42:56.340 --> 00:42:59.543
[Seungheon]
With a southpaw versus orthodox matchup,

833
00:42:59.610 --> 00:43:02.947
that previous round for distance
was tough on both sides.

834
00:43:04.748 --> 00:43:05.749
[bell rings]

835
00:43:05.816 --> 00:43:07.151
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X LEE GIJUN

836
00:43:07.217 --> 00:43:08.452
{\an8}[Seungheon] The second round begins.

837
00:43:08.519 --> 00:43:11.155
{\an8}How will Lee Gijun break through
Lee Chaehyun's solid boxing?

838
00:43:11.221 --> 00:43:12.356
{\an8}[spectator] Let's go, Lee Chaehyun!

839
00:43:12.423 --> 00:43:14.191
- [grunts]
- [Jongkook exclaims]

840
00:43:14.692 --> 00:43:15.693
[Lee] He's got a proper read.

841
00:43:18.429 --> 00:43:20.030
[all exclaiming]

842
00:43:20.631 --> 00:43:21.932
[Seungheon] Big right hand coming in.

843
00:43:22.433 --> 00:43:23.701
Ooh!

844
00:43:23.767 --> 00:43:25.369
[Lee] Boy, he caught a heavy one.

845
00:43:25.936 --> 00:43:28.672
[Gyuwon] He dipped low
and fired that straight right away!

846
00:43:28.739 --> 00:43:32.009
Yes, that's why
Gijun's counter landed clean.

847
00:43:32.843 --> 00:43:35.279
[Chaehyun] <i>Gijun was constantly trying</i>
<i>to close the distance.</i>

848
00:43:35.779 --> 00:43:37.481
<i>So I decided to turn up the pressure.</i>

849
00:43:40.951 --> 00:43:42.987
[Seungheon] Once again,
he steps inside for a big shot.

850
00:43:44.922 --> 00:43:47.024
- [in English] Break!
- Lee Gijun spotted a small opening

851
00:43:47.091 --> 00:43:48.559
in Lee Chaehyun's solid defense.

852
00:43:49.660 --> 00:43:51.061
[spectator] Prepare to guard up!

853
00:43:53.364 --> 00:43:55.165
[Seungheon]
Another stance switch from Lee Gijun.

854
00:43:55.232 --> 00:43:58.869
He's switching stances freely,
just moving however he wants.

855
00:44:02.773 --> 00:44:04.375
[Gyuwon]
He momentarily switched to southpaw,

856
00:44:04.441 --> 00:44:08.045
using the stance change
to throw Lee Chaehyun off.

857
00:44:09.113 --> 00:44:10.114
[referee] Break it up!

858
00:44:15.152 --> 00:44:17.121
- [both grunting]
- [Lee] Oh, boy!

859
00:44:19.123 --> 00:44:20.991
[Gijun] <i>Left-handers often struggle</i>

860
00:44:21.058 --> 00:44:23.027
<i>when facing opponents</i>
<i>using the same stance.</i>

861
00:44:24.962 --> 00:44:27.131
<i>That's why I kept changing stances</i>

862
00:44:27.197 --> 00:44:28.432
<i>while firing away.</i>

863
00:44:30.534 --> 00:44:32.269
{\an8}[Seungheon]
Lee Gijun's moving aggressively now.

864
00:44:35.305 --> 00:44:36.507
{\an8}That landed clean upstairs.

865
00:44:39.276 --> 00:44:40.911
{\an8}Lee Chaehyun attempts a combo!

866
00:44:42.046 --> 00:44:43.280
{\an8}- He steps to the side…
- [bell rings]

867
00:44:43.347 --> 00:44:44.348
{\an8}…and that ends the round.

868
00:44:47.051 --> 00:44:49.119
But still,
quarterfinals are quarterfinals.

869
00:44:49.186 --> 00:44:50.988
- It hits different.
- Seeing Chaehyun get hit,

870
00:44:51.055 --> 00:44:52.222
and shaken at times.

871
00:44:52.289 --> 00:44:53.891
- Right.
- You don't usually see that.

872
00:44:53.957 --> 00:44:56.293
- [Dex] Lee Chaehyun never struggles.
- [Jongkook] Exactly.

873
00:44:56.360 --> 00:44:57.628
You don't see this often.

874
00:44:57.695 --> 00:44:59.730
- [Lee] They're really showing their skill.
- [Jongkook] Yeah.

875
00:45:00.597 --> 00:45:02.466
Don't hold back. Just keep going.

876
00:45:02.533 --> 00:45:04.068
Strike, jab, throw some feints…

877
00:45:04.134 --> 00:45:05.269
Got it.

878
00:45:05.335 --> 00:45:07.204
[Chaehyun]
<i>I plan to attack more decisively</i>

879
00:45:07.271 --> 00:45:08.472
<i>and throw more punches.</i>

880
00:45:09.206 --> 00:45:11.241
Gijun, you got this, okay?

881
00:45:11.308 --> 00:45:13.143
Take it slow. You've got four more rounds.

882
00:45:14.144 --> 00:45:16.280
{\an8}[Seungheon] Neither fighter is showing
any signs of fatigue.

883
00:45:16.346 --> 00:45:18.048
{\an8}Waiting for the next round to start.

884
00:45:18.115 --> 00:45:19.383
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
CHAEHYUN: 19, GIJUN: 19

885
00:45:19.450 --> 00:45:21.518
{\an8}- [bell rings]
- And the third round begins!

886
00:45:22.119 --> 00:45:23.387
{\an8}[spectator] Stay calm!

887
00:45:24.755 --> 00:45:26.390
[Lee]
That's how they needed to move all along.

888
00:45:26.890 --> 00:45:28.625
[Jongkook] Yeah, that's much better.

889
00:45:30.260 --> 00:45:31.729
Man, he's really fast.

890
00:45:33.263 --> 00:45:34.965
[Gijun]
<i>I tried to edge in, little by little,</i>

891
00:45:35.032 --> 00:45:36.533
<i>then throw my lead hand.</i>

892
00:45:38.168 --> 00:45:39.870
[Dex]
It's like I'm watching a sword fight.

893
00:45:41.205 --> 00:45:43.373
[Jonghoon] That's it, one-two! Nice!

894
00:45:44.108 --> 00:45:45.375
[Lee] He's just too fast.

895
00:45:46.410 --> 00:45:48.779
[Gyuwon]
Lee Chaehyun never misses his moment.

896
00:45:49.813 --> 00:45:51.749
[Jonghoon] Nice timing, Chaehyun!

897
00:45:52.349 --> 00:45:53.383
All right!

898
00:45:54.985 --> 00:45:56.353
[referee] Hey, break it up! No holding.

899
00:45:57.955 --> 00:45:59.256
[spectator] All right, all right!

900
00:45:59.757 --> 00:46:01.458
He sure is a difficult one to hit.

901
00:46:02.459 --> 00:46:06.330
[Chaehyun] <i>My style is landing shots</i>
<i>without getting touched.</i>

902
00:46:06.396 --> 00:46:07.898
<i>I'll demonstrate that today.</i>

903
00:46:09.032 --> 00:46:10.501
- You're out of range!
- No!

904
00:46:10.567 --> 00:46:11.702
{\an8}Hit him right back!

905
00:46:12.269 --> 00:46:13.637
[exclaiming]

906
00:46:16.106 --> 00:46:18.442
- Nice going!
- He steps in and fires a straight.

907
00:46:18.509 --> 00:46:20.711
That's gotta land with real impact.

908
00:46:20.778 --> 00:46:22.646
Man, Lee Chaehyun's fast.

909
00:46:24.481 --> 00:46:27.818
[Lee]
He punches, then steps just out of range.

910
00:46:32.022 --> 00:46:34.324
[Seungheon]
Lee Chaehyun steps out of his reach.

911
00:46:35.425 --> 00:46:38.095
[Jongkook]
Wow, right on the edge of range.

912
00:46:49.473 --> 00:46:51.108
[both groan]

913
00:46:52.309 --> 00:46:55.512
[Lee] Chaehyun's punches
hurt more than you'd expect.

914
00:47:01.285 --> 00:47:02.286
[bell dings]

915
00:47:02.352 --> 00:47:04.488
{\an8}- Stop!
- And that's the end of this round.

916
00:47:04.555 --> 00:47:07.224
Lee Chaehyun's showing real experience.

917
00:47:07.291 --> 00:47:10.828
He's breaking Lee Gijun's rhythm
using various lead hand movements.

918
00:47:11.395 --> 00:47:13.797
Lee Chaehyun's just too fast.

919
00:47:13.864 --> 00:47:15.165
No joke.

920
00:47:15.232 --> 00:47:18.202
That's why Lee Gijun can't settle
into his usual rhythm at all.

921
00:47:20.003 --> 00:47:21.171
[Gijun] <i>I felt boxed in.</i>

922
00:47:21.905 --> 00:47:23.106
<i>From the third round,</i>

923
00:47:23.173 --> 00:47:27.911
<i>I planned to fight in my own rhythm.</i>

924
00:47:27.978 --> 00:47:29.947
<i>But his speed was making it impossible.</i>

925
00:47:31.381 --> 00:47:33.650
So far, his stamina looks okay.

926
00:47:35.819 --> 00:47:38.088
But it's his first time going six rounds.

927
00:47:40.090 --> 00:47:42.659
[Chaehyun] <i>It was my first three-minute,</i>
<i>six-round fight.</i>

928
00:47:42.726 --> 00:47:44.528
<i>That alone had me nervous.</i>

929
00:47:46.296 --> 00:47:47.631
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
CHAEHYUN: 29, GIJUN: 28

930
00:47:47.698 --> 00:47:50.300
{\an8}- Let's start the second round!
- [Lee] Let's go, you two!

931
00:47:51.001 --> 00:47:52.336
Let's go!

932
00:47:54.638 --> 00:47:56.373
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- [shouts]

933
00:47:56.440 --> 00:47:57.608
{\an8}- You got this!
- [bell dings]

934
00:47:57.674 --> 00:48:03.947
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X LEE GIJUN

935
00:48:05.616 --> 00:48:07.384
- [Dex] Yes, there you go.
- [Jongkook] Nice shot!

936
00:48:07.451 --> 00:48:10.320
[Gyuwon] Lee Gijun's turning it up now.

937
00:48:14.024 --> 00:48:15.492
Use the lead hand, man!

938
00:48:15.993 --> 00:48:17.227
[Lee] That's it, step in.

939
00:48:17.294 --> 00:48:19.529
- [Jongkook] Yes, move your head.
- [Lee] That's right.

940
00:48:20.797 --> 00:48:22.065
- All right!
- All right!

941
00:48:22.666 --> 00:48:24.801
[Seungheon] Lee Gijun lands a big one!

942
00:48:25.269 --> 00:48:27.204
[in English] Uppercut is there!

943
00:48:27.804 --> 00:48:30.307
[Lee, in Korean]
That was a great punch from Gijun.

944
00:48:33.277 --> 00:48:35.379
- Short shots, yes.
- [Seungheon] Lee Gijun keeps pressing!

945
00:48:35.445 --> 00:48:36.780
[Lee] Keep it short.

946
00:48:40.984 --> 00:48:42.853
- That's how you go in.
- [Jongkook] That's right.

947
00:48:42.920 --> 00:48:44.988
[Gyuwon]
Lee Chaehyun is starting to back up.

948
00:48:45.689 --> 00:48:48.058
It'll do him no favors
if he gets trapped in the corner.

949
00:48:50.861 --> 00:48:52.696
[Seungheon]
Lee Chaehyun backs up to the corner.

950
00:48:52.763 --> 00:48:54.831
It looks like
he's getting caught in this flow!

951
00:48:54.898 --> 00:48:56.800
He needs to regain control!

952
00:48:56.867 --> 00:48:58.335
- [bell dings]
- [in English] Stop!

953
00:48:58.869 --> 00:49:01.371
[Gyuwon, in Korean] This round was
a real opportunity for Lee Gijun.

954
00:49:01.438 --> 00:49:03.941
He needs to catch Lee Chaehyun
on the way in.

955
00:49:04.007 --> 00:49:05.575
Remember, he's just as tired.

956
00:49:05.642 --> 00:49:09.279
[Seungheon] Both fighters are preparing
for the next round.

957
00:49:09.746 --> 00:49:11.081
[whistle blows]

958
00:49:11.148 --> 00:49:12.983
Let's go, Lee Gijun!

959
00:49:13.050 --> 00:49:14.484
[spectator] You got this!

960
00:49:16.486 --> 00:49:17.487
[bell dings]

961
00:49:17.554 --> 00:49:18.855
{\an8}[referee] Okay, let's go!

962
00:49:18.922 --> 00:49:20.090
{\an8}[Seungheon] This is the fifth round.

963
00:49:20.157 --> 00:49:21.491
{\an8}[spectator] Let's go, Gijun!

964
00:49:21.558 --> 00:49:24.761
{\an8}[Seungheon] Round 5,
this is where stamina gets tested.

965
00:49:25.896 --> 00:49:27.497
- Here he comes.
- [spectator] That's it!

966
00:49:27.564 --> 00:49:29.066
[Seungheon] And Lee Chaehyun counters.

967
00:49:31.969 --> 00:49:33.637
He's finding his rhythm again.

968
00:49:38.875 --> 00:49:40.677
[Gyuwon] That's his signature move.
The slip and rip!

969
00:49:41.478 --> 00:49:42.746
You got this, Chaehyun!

970
00:49:42.813 --> 00:49:44.748
[Gyuwon] Now that is the art of timing.

971
00:49:46.817 --> 00:49:48.685
[audience exclaims]

972
00:49:48.752 --> 00:49:50.921
- [Jongkook] Nice shot!
- Nice, indeed.

973
00:49:51.588 --> 00:49:53.223
[Seungheon] He's back in rhythm.

974
00:49:55.158 --> 00:49:56.593
[Gyuwon] Whoa, a double combo!

975
00:49:57.995 --> 00:50:01.064
That combo was dangerous!
Look at him falter back!

976
00:50:03.900 --> 00:50:05.068
Go for it now!

977
00:50:05.135 --> 00:50:06.636
Go for it! Go for it!

978
00:50:06.703 --> 00:50:08.105
[Jongkook] Wait, what's he waiting for?

979
00:50:08.171 --> 00:50:09.172
What is he doing?

980
00:50:09.239 --> 00:50:10.340
Go for it. Oh, man.

981
00:50:11.942 --> 00:50:13.310
[Jongkook] Why didn't he go in?

982
00:50:16.413 --> 00:50:19.449
[Chaehyun] <i>It looked like</i>
<i>Lee Gijun's stamina had dipped.</i>

983
00:50:21.218 --> 00:50:22.719
[Seungheon] Body combo!

984
00:50:22.786 --> 00:50:25.489
[Chaehyun] <i>I figured I'd strike first</i>
<i>and break his rhythm.</i>

985
00:50:28.158 --> 00:50:29.726
[Seungheon] Back to the center.

986
00:50:30.694 --> 00:50:32.262
He tries firing combos again.

987
00:50:33.430 --> 00:50:35.432
[audience exclaims]

988
00:50:42.239 --> 00:50:43.273
[referee, in English] Slip!

989
00:50:43.774 --> 00:50:44.775
Slip, slip, slip.

990
00:50:47.544 --> 00:50:49.579
[Gyuwon, in Korean]
He can't lose focus here.

991
00:50:49.646 --> 00:50:52.749
[Gijun] <i>I got too amped up</i>
<i>and a little tense today,</i>

992
00:50:52.816 --> 00:50:54.151
<i>and my movements got too big.</i>

993
00:50:55.152 --> 00:50:57.988
- Gijun, deep breaths!
- You're okay, you're okay!

994
00:51:06.029 --> 00:51:07.431
Come on, let's go!

995
00:51:09.232 --> 00:51:11.802
[Gyuwon] Perhaps he's sensing
that Lee Gijun is going for the counter,

996
00:51:11.868 --> 00:51:13.336
he's being extra careful now.

997
00:51:13.403 --> 00:51:14.571
[Lee] Come on, throw combos.

998
00:51:14.638 --> 00:51:19.876
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X LEE GIJUN

999
00:51:19.943 --> 00:51:21.445
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [in English] Stop!

1000
00:51:23.647 --> 00:51:25.816
[Jongkook, in Korean]
Lee Chaehyun has the center.

1001
00:51:25.882 --> 00:51:29.186
That only makes things harder
for Lee Gijun.

1002
00:51:29.252 --> 00:51:31.455
[Dex]
It's my first time seeing him this tired.

1003
00:51:32.589 --> 00:51:35.425
[Seungheon] This tells me this next round
is going to be crucial.

1004
00:51:35.492 --> 00:51:38.395
If the final round goes like this,

1005
00:51:38.962 --> 00:51:41.531
one attacking, the other staying calm,

1006
00:51:42.032 --> 00:51:46.269
the fighter who keeps it simple
will take the win.

1007
00:51:47.003 --> 00:51:48.371
[Dex] Is it already the last round?

1008
00:51:48.438 --> 00:51:50.273
- That went by way too fast.
- Seriously.

1009
00:51:50.340 --> 00:51:51.741
Those rounds just flew by.

1010
00:51:51.808 --> 00:51:53.376
That went by in a blur.

1011
00:51:53.443 --> 00:51:54.978
It's Round 6 already?

1012
00:51:55.045 --> 00:51:57.681
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
CHAEHYUN: 48, GIJUN: 47

1013
00:51:57.747 --> 00:52:00.484
{\an8}- [spectator] Let's go!
- Go, Gijun!

1014
00:52:00.951 --> 00:52:03.787
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1015
00:52:03.854 --> 00:52:05.689
- [bell dings]
- All right, seconds out.

1016
00:52:06.990 --> 00:52:09.459
[Seungheon]
I wonder how much they've recovered.

1017
00:52:09.526 --> 00:52:12.362
Lee Chaehyun and Lee Gijun,
about to head into the final round.

1018
00:52:12.429 --> 00:52:13.830
This is going to be fire!

1019
00:52:14.331 --> 00:52:16.299
Let's turn up the heat in here.

1020
00:52:16.867 --> 00:52:19.603
{\an8}[Gyuwon] Which fighter's punches
will spark fireworks?

1021
00:52:19.669 --> 00:52:21.004
{\an8}- Let's find out now!
- You got this!

1022
00:52:21.605 --> 00:52:23.240
{\an8}[Seungheon] Round 6 has started.

1023
00:52:23.306 --> 00:52:24.641
Okay, box!

1024
00:52:26.243 --> 00:52:27.544
Yes, push hard!

1025
00:52:27.611 --> 00:52:29.646
- Yes, there you go!
- [Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun falls back.

1026
00:52:31.348 --> 00:52:33.116
Lee Gijun is hunting for a big shot.

1027
00:52:33.183 --> 00:52:34.784
That left hand fell a bit short.

1028
00:52:38.388 --> 00:52:40.323
This is it, Gijun! Last round!

1029
00:52:40.390 --> 00:52:42.659
All right, this is it! Use your lead hand!

1030
00:52:42.726 --> 00:52:43.894
[Seungheon] They trade punches.

1031
00:52:43.960 --> 00:52:45.095
You have to go now!

1032
00:52:48.031 --> 00:52:49.699
Gijun, don't just stand there!

1033
00:52:51.034 --> 00:52:52.269
Remember, last round.

1034
00:52:56.439 --> 00:52:58.742
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun backs off,
clearly aware of the counter.

1035
00:52:59.476 --> 00:53:01.077
Lee Chaehyun has the center.

1036
00:53:03.380 --> 00:53:05.215
[Gyuwon]
The more he hunts for that one big shot,

1037
00:53:05.282 --> 00:53:07.050
the more his stamina drains!

1038
00:53:10.020 --> 00:53:12.022
When you judge offensive control,

1039
00:53:12.088 --> 00:53:14.224
it really comes down to
who owns the center!

1040
00:53:14.291 --> 00:53:16.293
Right now, that's Lee Chaehyun!

1041
00:53:17.394 --> 00:53:20.697
[Seungheon] Clearly, we're seeing
some stamina issues for Lee Gijun here.

1042
00:53:20.764 --> 00:53:22.766
Lee Chaehyun steps back to the center.

1043
00:53:22.832 --> 00:53:24.301
Come on, extend your arm!

1044
00:53:30.941 --> 00:53:32.509
[Seungheon] Oh, that was a big left jab!

1045
00:53:32.576 --> 00:53:34.110
[exclaiming]

1046
00:53:37.447 --> 00:53:38.615
[spectator] Go, Lee Gijun!

1047
00:53:38.682 --> 00:53:40.450
Gijun, you have to strike first!

1048
00:53:45.055 --> 00:53:46.022
It's now or never.

1049
00:53:46.089 --> 00:53:47.290
Crash into him!

1050
00:53:47.357 --> 00:53:49.960
Jab, jab! Stick the jab!

1051
00:53:52.395 --> 00:53:53.730
[Seungheon] Incoming Lee Gijun!

1052
00:53:53.797 --> 00:53:56.032
- Keep going!
- You got this!

1053
00:53:57.968 --> 00:54:00.370
- [Jongkook] See that uppercut?
- [Lee exclaims]

1054
00:54:00.437 --> 00:54:01.438
[in English] Break!

1055
00:54:01.504 --> 00:54:05.575
[Seungheon, in Korean] Both fighters
are running on fumes at this point.

1056
00:54:05.642 --> 00:54:07.677
[in English] Keep going, keep going!

1057
00:54:07.744 --> 00:54:10.146
- [in Korean] Go, Chaehyun!
- You got this, Chaehyun!

1058
00:54:12.482 --> 00:54:13.516
{\an8}[spectator] Ten seconds!

1059
00:54:13.984 --> 00:54:15.719
Ten seconds! Fire now!

1060
00:54:19.122 --> 00:54:20.257
[referee, in English] Slip, slip!

1061
00:54:22.492 --> 00:54:23.526
Slip, slip!

1062
00:54:27.497 --> 00:54:28.732
[Jongkook, in Korean] His stamina's gone.

1063
00:54:28.798 --> 00:54:30.433
He's totally spent.

1064
00:54:31.134 --> 00:54:32.135
[referee] Okay, go!

1065
00:54:34.271 --> 00:54:35.805
[Dex exclaiming]

1066
00:54:40.243 --> 00:54:41.411
[Gyuwon exclaims]

1067
00:54:42.412 --> 00:54:44.080
That punch was lightning fast!

1068
00:54:44.147 --> 00:54:45.315
Stop! [in English]

1069
00:54:45.949 --> 00:54:49.286
[Seungheon] And the fight is over!
Lee Chaehyun versus Lee Gijun!

1070
00:54:49.352 --> 00:54:50.654
[shouts]

1071
00:54:50.720 --> 00:54:52.889
[Gyuwon] Well, I'll be…

1072
00:54:52.956 --> 00:54:55.492
What a beautiful display of timing!

1073
00:54:55.558 --> 00:54:57.527
That was an incredible fight!

1074
00:54:58.928 --> 00:55:00.363
- That connected, right?
- It did.

1075
00:55:00.430 --> 00:55:02.232
- He drove it home.
- That's why in boxing,

1076
00:55:02.299 --> 00:55:05.201
you can't let your guard down
till the bell rings.

1077
00:55:05.268 --> 00:55:06.936
He really nailed that one.

1078
00:55:09.205 --> 00:55:10.874
[Seungheon]
We now await the judges' decision.

1079
00:55:12.375 --> 00:55:14.778
Judge one scores it for…

1080
00:55:19.449 --> 00:55:20.850
{\an8}Lee Chaehyun in the red corner.

1081
00:55:20.917 --> 00:55:23.586
{\an8}JUDGE 1
RED CORNER LEE CHAEHYUN WINS

1082
00:55:27.757 --> 00:55:30.226
Moving on, judge two scores it for…

1083
00:55:31.961 --> 00:55:33.430
{\an8}Lee Chaehyun in the red corner!

1084
00:55:33.496 --> 00:55:34.898
{\an8}CHAEHYUN ADVANCES TO THE SEMIFINALS

1085
00:55:34.964 --> 00:55:36.066
{\an8}Congratulations!

1086
00:55:36.533 --> 00:55:38.134
[Lee] All right then,

1087
00:55:38.201 --> 00:55:41.805
the winner of this bout is
Lee Chaehyun in the red corner.

1088
00:55:43.006 --> 00:55:46.076
First of all, I'd like to thank Lee Gijun

1089
00:55:46.142 --> 00:55:49.679
for putting up a great fight.

1090
00:55:50.246 --> 00:55:52.482
I truly…

1091
00:55:53.450 --> 00:55:55.185
love boxing.

1092
00:55:55.685 --> 00:56:00.090
Honestly, boxing is my life.

1093
00:56:00.623 --> 00:56:04.060
My father was the one
who introduced me to boxing.

1094
00:56:04.127 --> 00:56:08.231
And my mother has come to every fight

1095
00:56:08.298 --> 00:56:10.467
and supported me the whole way.

1096
00:56:10.934 --> 00:56:12.102
I want to say thank you,

1097
00:56:12.168 --> 00:56:15.038
and that I want to make you proud.

1098
00:56:15.538 --> 00:56:17.240
Mom and Dad, I love you!

1099
00:56:17.307 --> 00:56:19.075
- We love you too!
- We love you too!

1100
00:56:25.215 --> 00:56:26.583
[Gijun] First off,

1101
00:56:26.649 --> 00:56:30.553
I want to thank my teammates
at Woosuk University.

1102
00:56:31.121 --> 00:56:32.589
I'll keep working harder

1103
00:56:33.356 --> 00:56:35.725
and become a fighter that people notice.

1104
00:56:35.792 --> 00:56:37.127
Thank you.

1105
00:56:39.429 --> 00:56:40.897
Great job!

1106
00:56:45.034 --> 00:56:47.437
When I first started boxing,

1107
00:56:47.504 --> 00:56:50.440
a lot of people said I wouldn't make it.

1108
00:56:50.507 --> 00:56:53.176
<i>Even so, I've come this far.</i>

1109
00:56:53.943 --> 00:56:57.580
<i>I wouldn't be here</i>
<i>without the Woosuk University boxing team</i>

1110
00:56:57.647 --> 00:57:01.217
<i>believing in me and training with me.</i>

1111
00:57:01.284 --> 00:57:03.186
<i>So I'm grateful for that.</i>

1112
00:57:03.253 --> 00:57:07.257
I'll strive to become
a Korean boxer worth watching.

1113
00:57:08.124 --> 00:57:10.193
[Lee] Let's keep this energy going

1114
00:57:10.260 --> 00:57:12.195
and introduce the advisors

1115
00:57:12.262 --> 00:57:14.564
who helped make<i> I Am Boxer</i> possible.

1116
00:57:14.631 --> 00:57:18.168
Former WBA junior flyweight champion,

1117
00:57:18.234 --> 00:57:21.337
and an International Boxing Hall of Fame
inductee, Yuh Myungwoo!

1118
00:57:23.640 --> 00:57:26.009
{\an8}YUH MYUNGWOO
FORMER JUNIOR FLYWEIGHT CHAMP

1119
00:57:26.075 --> 00:57:29.879
{\an8}[Lee] And with the expertise
of Korea's top boxing professionals,

1120
00:57:29.946 --> 00:57:31.748
{\an8}<i>I Am Boxer</i> comes to life.

1121
00:57:31.815 --> 00:57:34.284
{\an8}Once again, let's give them a big hand!

1122
00:57:37.821 --> 00:57:38.922
[Dex] I'm sure you all know,

1123
00:57:38.988 --> 00:57:42.192
but the most anticipated fight
always comes last.

1124
00:57:43.460 --> 00:57:47.197
That final bout is just moments away.

1125
00:57:50.600 --> 00:57:51.601
{\an8}KWON OHGON X HONG SUNGMIN

1126
00:57:51.668 --> 00:57:52.836
{\an8}AGE: 30, 24
HEIGHT: 181 CM, 173 CM

1127
00:57:52.902 --> 00:57:54.070
{\an8}WEIGHT: 79 KG, 84 KG
REACH: 181 CM, 175 CM

1128
00:57:54.904 --> 00:57:55.905
[exclaims]

1129
00:57:57.507 --> 00:57:59.542
[spectator]
Man, they really stacked this matchup.

1130
00:58:00.210 --> 00:58:02.612
[Dex] Let's call the fighters in.

1131
00:58:02.679 --> 00:58:04.714
Entering from the blue corner,

1132
00:58:04.781 --> 00:58:07.884
Tyson, Hong Sungmin!

1133
00:58:09.118 --> 00:58:11.120
[Sungmin] <i>Throughout my whole career</i>
<i>as an amateur boxer,</i>

1134
00:58:11.187 --> 00:58:13.823
<i>I've never stood on a stage so big</i>

1135
00:58:13.890 --> 00:58:16.359
<i>with so many spectators.</i>

1136
00:58:17.393 --> 00:58:18.828
<i>That's what got me more stoked.</i>

1137
00:58:23.132 --> 00:58:25.602
[audience applauding, cheering]

1138
00:58:35.311 --> 00:58:37.347
[spectators exclaiming]

1139
00:58:40.984 --> 00:58:43.119
[Jongkook]
Hong Sungmin is a real character.

1140
00:58:46.222 --> 00:58:47.690
[spectator 1] He's born for the spotlight.

1141
00:58:48.892 --> 00:58:50.527
[Dex chuckles] He's relaxed.

1142
00:58:51.728 --> 00:58:53.162
[spectator 2] Let's go, Hong Sungmin!

1143
00:58:57.500 --> 00:58:59.369
TYSON
HONG SUNGMIN

1144
00:59:07.844 --> 00:59:08.878
[Dex exclaims]

1145
00:59:08.945 --> 00:59:10.380
[spectator 1] It's the car.

1146
00:59:10.446 --> 00:59:11.447
[Dex laughing]

1147
00:59:11.514 --> 00:59:13.349
He's saying he wants the car!

1148
00:59:23.560 --> 00:59:25.295
{\an8}HONG SUNGMIN'S PARENTS

1149
00:59:31.968 --> 00:59:34.938
[Sungmin] <i>I first went to a boxing gym</i>
<i>just to lose weight,</i>

1150
00:59:35.838 --> 00:59:37.440
<i>and somehow ended up here.</i>

1151
00:59:38.007 --> 00:59:42.412
<i>I used to think talent was</i>
<i>what got you to the top.</i>

1152
00:59:42.879 --> 00:59:45.915
<i>But now I believe it's the one</i>
<i>who works harder and wants it more</i>

1153
00:59:46.416 --> 00:59:49.018
<i>who comes out on top.</i>

1154
00:59:49.852 --> 00:59:51.621
<i>So I've trained harder than anyone else.</i>

1155
00:59:51.688 --> 00:59:55.358
<i>And now, I trust the body I've built</i>
<i>over the years.</i>

1156
00:59:55.425 --> 00:59:57.393
<i>I'm confident I can take on anyone.</i>

1157
01:00:00.630 --> 01:00:04.534
[Jongkook] Entering from the red corner,
Thunder, Kwon Ohgon!

1158
01:00:05.101 --> 01:00:08.404
{\an8}KWON OHGON'S WIFE AND GRANDMOTHER

1159
01:00:10.340 --> 01:00:14.577
<i>It's been three years</i>
<i>since I last fought in front of a crowd.</i>

1160
01:00:15.211 --> 01:00:16.579
<i>Hearing the cheers again</i>

1161
01:00:17.146 --> 01:00:18.247
<i>really got me excited.</i>

1162
01:00:19.115 --> 01:00:22.185
KWON OHGON

1163
01:00:22.251 --> 01:00:24.854
[Gyuwon] He must have missed
this kind of crowd energy.

1164
01:00:24.921 --> 01:00:26.089
Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!

1165
01:00:26.155 --> 01:00:27.490
[whooping]

1166
01:00:28.291 --> 01:00:29.459
[Dex] Thunder!

1167
01:00:30.159 --> 01:00:31.728
You're the best, man!

1168
01:00:35.732 --> 01:00:37.800
[Dex] He's a total superstar!

1169
01:00:37.867 --> 01:00:39.802
The superstar of boxing!

1170
01:00:40.303 --> 01:00:41.838
[cheering, whooping]

1171
01:00:44.574 --> 01:00:47.810
Man, he's getting a big reception.

1172
01:00:52.815 --> 01:00:54.384
[spectator] Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!

1173
01:00:54.450 --> 01:00:57.253
- Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!
- Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!

1174
01:00:57.320 --> 01:00:59.489
BOXING G.O.A.T CHAMP KWON OHGON
THE MAN WHO NEVER LOSES

1175
01:00:59.555 --> 01:01:00.823
You got this, Ohgon!

1176
01:01:00.890 --> 01:01:02.458
Let's go, Ohgon!

1177
01:01:09.732 --> 01:01:11.868
[Seungheon] And here he is,
back in the ring!

1178
01:01:11.934 --> 01:01:12.935
Kwon Ohgon!

1179
01:01:17.674 --> 01:01:19.709
His wife, whom he met after retiring,

1180
01:01:19.776 --> 01:01:22.211
is here to watch him fight
for the very first time.

1181
01:01:23.680 --> 01:01:24.814
Slept well?

1182
01:01:25.515 --> 01:01:26.516
{\an8}KWON HORANG
OHGON'S SON

1183
01:01:26.582 --> 01:01:28.985
{\an8}Horang, my boy. I missed you.

1184
01:01:29.052 --> 01:01:31.521
<i>I met my wife after I retired,</i>

1185
01:01:31.587 --> 01:01:34.057
<i>so she's never seen me box.</i>

1186
01:01:35.258 --> 01:01:39.962
When I think about you going up against
such tough opponents,

1187
01:01:40.563 --> 01:01:43.199
I worry you'll get hit,
and that it'll hurt.

1188
01:01:43.266 --> 01:01:44.867
That's what worries me the most.

1189
01:01:45.968 --> 01:01:47.737
Then, I guess I'll have to win.

1190
01:01:49.038 --> 01:01:50.139
Extend all the way.

1191
01:01:50.206 --> 01:01:51.841
<i>I want to show my wife and child</i>

1192
01:01:52.742 --> 01:01:57.613
<i>the kind of fighter I once was.</i>

1193
01:01:58.748 --> 01:02:02.118
Show me! Show me what you've got, mister!

1194
01:02:03.820 --> 01:02:06.856
- [spectator] Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!
- Let's do this!

1195
01:02:10.827 --> 01:02:13.196
Let's go, Hong Sungmin!

1196
01:02:14.497 --> 01:02:17.967
[Lee] Hong Sungmin's
already working the crowd.

1197
01:02:20.036 --> 01:02:21.904
[Dex] That's the kind of fighter he is.

1198
01:02:22.872 --> 01:02:27.176
Kwon Ohgon,
I'm sure you know that this match

1199
01:02:27.243 --> 01:02:28.344
will be your last one.

1200
01:02:28.411 --> 01:02:29.712
Whoo!

1201
01:02:30.780 --> 01:02:32.715
So I'd like to apologize in advance.

1202
01:02:33.816 --> 01:02:36.285
There's a reason my ring name is "Tyson,"

1203
01:02:36.853 --> 01:02:38.888
and why they call me the nuclear puncher.

1204
01:02:38.955 --> 01:02:43.059
I'll make sure
everyone here sees it tonight.

1205
01:02:48.998 --> 01:02:52.034
It's been three years
since I've fought in front of a crowd,

1206
01:02:52.769 --> 01:02:55.304
but I'm more excited than nervous.

1207
01:02:55.371 --> 01:02:59.976
I'm the last remaining pro boxer
in this survival show.

1208
01:03:00.576 --> 01:03:02.845
I'm not worried about weight classes.

1209
01:03:02.912 --> 01:03:05.915
I'll just show you exactly
why I was a two-division champion.

1210
01:03:05.982 --> 01:03:06.983
You'll see.

1211
01:03:07.049 --> 01:03:09.318
- Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!
- Let's go!

1212
01:03:09.385 --> 01:03:11.687
{\an8}BOXING G.O.A.T CHAMP KWON OHGON

1213
01:03:12.522 --> 01:03:15.191
[Gyuwon] This fight has
a very clear theme.

1214
01:03:15.258 --> 01:03:17.860
A clash of speed versus power.

1215
01:03:17.927 --> 01:03:22.064
Kwon Ohgon is known for his speed
in both the amateur and pro scenes.

1216
01:03:22.131 --> 01:03:24.667
He scores knockouts
with his lightning-fast movement

1217
01:03:24.734 --> 01:03:27.804
and showcases the art of timing
through his boxing.

1218
01:03:29.038 --> 01:03:31.741
On the other hand,
Hong Sungmin is a power boxer,

1219
01:03:31.808 --> 01:03:34.177
right in step
with the global trend in boxing.

1220
01:03:34.677 --> 01:03:37.480
His punching power is extremely dangerous.

1221
01:03:38.548 --> 01:03:43.186
Fighters, show us what you're known for.

1222
01:03:43.820 --> 01:03:46.422
{\an8}KWON OHGON'S WIFE

1223
01:03:47.223 --> 01:03:50.226
[Ohgon] <i>I've done ten-rounders before,</i>

1224
01:03:50.293 --> 01:03:53.629
<i>and Hong Sungmin</i>
<i>has never fought in a six-rounder.</i>

1225
01:03:54.363 --> 01:03:56.566
[Sungmin] <i>None of that matters to me.</i>

1226
01:03:57.099 --> 01:03:58.768
<i>I'm going in to smash everything.</i>

1227
01:04:00.469 --> 01:04:02.305
[spectator] Let's go, Hong Sungmin!

1228
01:04:02.872 --> 01:04:05.074
[spectator 2] Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!

1229
01:04:05.141 --> 01:04:06.275
Box!

1230
01:04:06.342 --> 01:04:07.343
{\an8}[bell dings]

1231
01:04:07.410 --> 01:04:08.945
{\an8}KWON OHGON X HONG SUNGMIN

1232
01:04:09.011 --> 01:04:10.746
{\an8}[Seungheon]
It's the final quarterfinal bout.

1233
01:04:10.813 --> 01:04:13.449
Kwon Ohgon versus Hong Sungmin begins now.

1234
01:04:13.516 --> 01:04:16.052
- [Gyuwon] You're about to see real class.
- [Seungheon] That's right.

1235
01:04:23.726 --> 01:04:25.294
Hong Sungmin slowly comes in.

1236
01:04:26.062 --> 01:04:27.063
Nice body shot!

1237
01:04:27.129 --> 01:04:28.364
[groans]

1238
01:04:28.431 --> 01:04:29.866
Did I hear bones breaking?

1239
01:04:32.201 --> 01:04:34.036
[Lee] Didn't connect, landed on his guard.

1240
01:04:35.738 --> 01:04:37.073
[Seungheon] He's hunting for the big one.

1241
01:04:37.139 --> 01:04:39.842
[Sungmin] <i>I'm in the higher weight class</i>

1242
01:04:39.909 --> 01:04:41.010
<i>and I have more power,</i>

1243
01:04:41.077 --> 01:04:44.380
<i>so my plan was to score points</i>
<i>by landing big shots, one at a time.</i>

1244
01:04:45.314 --> 01:04:46.716
[spectators groan]

1245
01:04:52.088 --> 01:04:53.956
[Gyuwon] You can tell they're
both experienced,

1246
01:04:54.023 --> 01:04:56.425
taking their time and reading each other.

1247
01:04:57.827 --> 01:05:00.429
[Seungheon] Hong Sungmin slowly
adds pressure.

1248
01:05:01.197 --> 01:05:02.632
- Oh!
- [Lee] Oh!

1249
01:05:02.698 --> 01:05:04.433
That right there is dangerous.

1250
01:05:04.500 --> 01:05:07.503
- He's got power. One clean shot ends it.
- Right.

1251
01:05:10.539 --> 01:05:11.841
[spectators gasp]

1252
01:05:11.908 --> 01:05:12.909
Nice going!

1253
01:05:14.744 --> 01:05:16.412
Let's go, honey!

1254
01:05:16.479 --> 01:05:18.814
[spectators laugh, cheer]

1255
01:05:18.881 --> 01:05:21.384
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

1256
01:05:22.752 --> 01:05:26.656
[Ohgon] <i>My strength is my explosive speed.</i>

1257
01:05:28.257 --> 01:05:31.327
<i>The plan was to find openings</i>
<i>and attack them hard and fast.</i>

1258
01:05:32.795 --> 01:05:34.230
[spectators exclaim]

1259
01:05:35.431 --> 01:05:36.699
He's fast.

1260
01:05:36.766 --> 01:05:38.801
[Seungheon] So there was
a gap in that guard!

1261
01:05:38.868 --> 01:05:41.170
And Kwon Ohgon dug right into it!

1262
01:05:44.373 --> 01:05:46.309
Looks like he's found an opening again.

1263
01:05:47.310 --> 01:05:48.477
That's it!

1264
01:05:49.478 --> 01:05:52.481
Man, those hands are fast.
You can't even see them.

1265
01:05:57.687 --> 01:05:58.721
Short shots up top.

1266
01:05:59.689 --> 01:06:01.057
That's it.

1267
01:06:01.123 --> 01:06:06.062
[Gyuwon] Kwon is clearly controlling
the fight with his superior speed.

1268
01:06:11.367 --> 01:06:13.669
{\an8}Oh… Neat blocking moves.

1269
01:06:14.236 --> 01:06:16.505
[exclaiming]

1270
01:06:23.779 --> 01:06:25.781
{\an8}Did you see those moves? What was that?

1271
01:06:25.848 --> 01:06:26.983
{\an8}Did he teleport or what?

1272
01:06:28.784 --> 01:06:30.453
- [bell dings]
- Stop!

1273
01:06:31.587 --> 01:06:32.788
[Seungheon] That concludes this round.

1274
01:06:32.855 --> 01:06:35.825
[Gyuwon] The first round was filled
with intense mental warfare.

1275
01:06:41.664 --> 01:06:43.132
{\an8}HONG SUNGMIN'S MOTHER

1276
01:06:43.199 --> 01:06:44.533
My heart's pounding…

1277
01:06:46.135 --> 01:06:48.738
It's a battle of true masters.

1278
01:06:48.804 --> 01:06:49.805
This is real boxing.

1279
01:06:49.872 --> 01:06:51.107
- Yeah.
- No doubt.

1280
01:06:51.173 --> 01:06:52.775
This is boxing at its best.

1281
01:06:56.212 --> 01:06:58.614
- Bring over his chair.
- Nah, don't need one.

1282
01:06:58.681 --> 01:07:00.583
[Seungheon]
Wow, neither fighter is sitting down.

1283
01:07:00.649 --> 01:07:03.786
Hong Sungmin just said he didn't need one.

1284
01:07:03.853 --> 01:07:06.489
And Kwon Ohgon,
back in the ring after three years,

1285
01:07:06.555 --> 01:07:08.758
is savoring every step on the canvas.

1286
01:07:09.258 --> 01:07:10.459
Your tempo's good.

1287
01:07:10.526 --> 01:07:11.861
Just manage your pace.

1288
01:07:11.927 --> 01:07:12.928
And take your time.

1289
01:07:13.429 --> 01:07:15.731
[Ohgon] <i>I think I did okay just now.</i>

1290
01:07:15.798 --> 01:07:17.933
<i>I'll just keep this up next round.</i>

1291
01:07:18.000 --> 01:07:19.235
<i>I think I can win this.</i>

1292
01:07:20.036 --> 01:07:22.571
You're doing well,
but you're swinging a bit wide.

1293
01:07:22.638 --> 01:07:24.974
- Yeah, I know that.
- Yeah? Okay.

1294
01:07:25.975 --> 01:07:28.010
[Sungmin] <i>I need to loosen up more.</i>

1295
01:07:28.077 --> 01:07:29.912
<i>My body's still a bit stiff.</i>

1296
01:07:31.047 --> 01:07:32.281
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KWON: 10, HONG: 9

1297
01:07:32.348 --> 01:07:34.650
{\an8}[spectator] Let's go, Kwon Ohgon!

1298
01:07:41.624 --> 01:07:43.325
With these two, it's a real boxing match.

1299
01:07:44.593 --> 01:07:47.196
- [Seungheon] The fourth quarterfinal bout.
- [bell dings]

1300
01:07:47.263 --> 01:07:49.198
- Box!
- Second round starts now!

1301
01:07:50.800 --> 01:07:52.701
Hong Sungmin inches forward.

1302
01:07:56.605 --> 01:07:58.841
- [spectators groan]
- He steps in and lets it go.

1303
01:08:03.345 --> 01:08:04.580
[Jongkook] It's not landing.

1304
01:08:06.582 --> 01:08:08.017
Neither one's giving openings.

1305
01:08:08.084 --> 01:08:10.086
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1306
01:08:12.688 --> 01:08:15.057
[Gyuwon] Both are locked
in a fierce battle,

1307
01:08:15.124 --> 01:08:17.827
trying to read each other's timing.

1308
01:08:17.893 --> 01:08:18.894
[Seungheon] That's right.

1309
01:08:21.130 --> 01:08:23.833
[Dex] So much happening
in that tight space.

1310
01:08:23.899 --> 01:08:25.267
[Lee] Gosh, it's a battle of timing.

1311
01:08:31.107 --> 01:08:32.875
And he strikes with the right!

1312
01:08:32.942 --> 01:08:34.710
Kwon Ohgon's one-two combo!

1313
01:08:34.777 --> 01:08:35.811
[judges, spectators exclaim]

1314
01:08:36.512 --> 01:08:37.713
Kwon Ohgon's fast.

1315
01:08:39.882 --> 01:08:42.818
[Ohgon] <i>If I read those punches well</i>
<i>and counter clean,</i>

1316
01:08:42.885 --> 01:08:44.487
<i>I might get to break his rhythm.</i>

1317
01:08:45.054 --> 01:08:46.956
[Gyuwon] Hong's trying
to establish his rhythm,

1318
01:08:47.022 --> 01:08:48.591
but Kwon keeps striking first.

1319
01:08:52.161 --> 01:08:53.262
And he swings his right!

1320
01:08:56.699 --> 01:08:58.467
And he swings his right!

1321
01:08:58.534 --> 01:09:01.303
Kwon Ohgon never misses an opening!

1322
01:09:01.904 --> 01:09:04.073
[Seungheon] Hong Sungmin ducks,
guard tight!

1323
01:09:06.876 --> 01:09:08.277
Nice shot!

1324
01:09:09.712 --> 01:09:11.847
Kwon's so fast it's hard to see!

1325
01:09:12.815 --> 01:09:16.385
[Don exclaims] He's fast.

1326
01:09:17.786 --> 01:09:19.488
Ohgon's landing clean tonight.

1327
01:09:20.489 --> 01:09:22.491
He's in great form tonight.

1328
01:09:25.327 --> 01:09:27.930
[Sungmin] <i>Honestly,</i>
<i>I was surprised by his speed.</i>

1329
01:09:27.997 --> 01:09:29.899
<i>I thought I might lose my flow.</i>

1330
01:09:36.338 --> 01:09:37.773
[Dex] He's got composure, too.

1331
01:09:41.010 --> 01:09:44.413
[Gyuwon] Kwon Ohgon is lowering
his level to change his stance

1332
01:09:44.480 --> 01:09:46.549
and throw off Hong Sungmin's accuracy.

1333
01:09:49.185 --> 01:09:51.220
{\an8}Kwon Ohgon shoots… and lands!

1334
01:09:51.887 --> 01:09:52.888
…and lands!

1335
01:09:53.455 --> 01:09:54.690
[Lee] Nice cross-counter.

1336
01:09:56.192 --> 01:09:57.760
[Seungheon] Another exchange of big shots.

1337
01:09:58.327 --> 01:09:59.328
And Hong lands!

1338
01:10:00.029 --> 01:10:01.430
{\an8}And Hong lands!

1339
01:10:01.497 --> 01:10:04.200
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- And that concludes this round!

1340
01:10:08.938 --> 01:10:11.440
[Lee] Wow, this is a hell of a fight.

1341
01:10:13.042 --> 01:10:15.711
Feet planted,
trading right in rhythm at that range.

1342
01:10:17.012 --> 01:10:20.883
I was curious to see what kind
of game plan Kwon Ohgon would bring

1343
01:10:20.950 --> 01:10:22.985
against Hong Sungmin's infighter style.

1344
01:10:23.052 --> 01:10:26.555
I thought Kwon Ohgon might show us
some out-boxing today.

1345
01:10:26.622 --> 01:10:28.357
- That's what I figured.
- Exactly.

1346
01:10:28.424 --> 01:10:31.327
Turns out, the fight is unfolding
in a completely different direction.

1347
01:10:32.661 --> 01:10:35.798
[Sungmin] <i>I thought,</i>
<i>"He's not backing out at all."</i>

1348
01:10:35.864 --> 01:10:38.834
<i>"Then I'll land a few big shots</i>
<i>and slow him down."</i>

1349
01:10:39.635 --> 01:10:42.972
Seeing power fighters plant their feet
and fight at close range,

1350
01:10:43.038 --> 01:10:45.574
{\an8}- the tension is unreal.
- [bell dings]

1351
01:10:45.641 --> 01:10:47.276
{\an8}- The third round has started.
- Box!

1352
01:10:47.343 --> 01:10:49.478
{\an8}You got this! Let's go!

1353
01:10:49.545 --> 01:10:51.981
{\an8}KWON OHGON X HONG SUNGMIN

1354
01:10:52.047 --> 01:10:54.683
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KWON: 20, HONG: 18

1355
01:10:54.750 --> 01:10:55.751
{\an8}Big swing there.

1356
01:10:56.285 --> 01:10:57.653
Too big, son!

1357
01:10:59.989 --> 01:11:01.624
Hong's hunting for the right timing.

1358
01:11:02.258 --> 01:11:03.993
He's stepping in. But again!

1359
01:11:04.493 --> 01:11:06.395
He's stepping in. But again!

1360
01:11:07.563 --> 01:11:09.832
[Lee] Ohgon's read his timing here.

1361
01:11:14.503 --> 01:11:15.971
[spectators gasp]

1362
01:11:16.939 --> 01:11:17.940
Let's go!

1363
01:11:19.842 --> 01:11:20.876
[Lee] Hong Sungmin…

1364
01:11:21.410 --> 01:11:24.780
His timing's off against Ohgon right now.

1365
01:11:28.984 --> 01:11:31.387
[Gyuwon] Kwon Ohgon is half a beat faster.

1366
01:11:32.454 --> 01:11:35.724
When Hong tries to set his rhythm
and find an opening,

1367
01:11:37.559 --> 01:11:40.062
Kwon beats him to it and strikes first.

1368
01:11:44.233 --> 01:11:45.601
[Lee] No, that didn't connect.

1369
01:11:45.668 --> 01:11:48.771
[Seungheon] Kwon Ohgon gives him
the head shake!

1370
01:11:57.479 --> 01:12:00.215
And he escapes!
Momentum's starting to swing Kwon's way!

1371
01:12:02.318 --> 01:12:03.352
So light on his feet.

1372
01:12:05.854 --> 01:12:08.657
Kwon Ohgon keeps pressuring on the inside,

1373
01:12:08.724 --> 01:12:11.827
making it very hard
for Hong Sungmin to find his timing.

1374
01:12:11.894 --> 01:12:12.995
Big swing from Hong.

1375
01:12:13.595 --> 01:12:14.763
Kwon takes a step in.

1376
01:12:14.830 --> 01:12:15.964
And works the body!

1377
01:12:19.368 --> 01:12:21.670
[Lee] Ohgon's very sharp tonight.

1378
01:12:21.737 --> 01:12:23.439
He's gonna be hard to take.

1379
01:12:23.505 --> 01:12:25.074
Sungmin needs to raise the bar now.

1380
01:12:25.140 --> 01:12:27.710
{\an8}- Let's go!
- Let's go!

1381
01:12:27.776 --> 01:12:29.311
{\an8}[Seungheon] Cross to the face!

1382
01:12:29.378 --> 01:12:30.612
{\an8}Hong Sungmin lands clean!

1383
01:12:30.679 --> 01:12:31.980
{\an8}Kwon counters!

1384
01:12:32.514 --> 01:12:34.950
{\an8}Hong Sungmin is trying
to rebuild his rhythm.

1385
01:12:35.918 --> 01:12:37.453
{\an8}Kwon drops his level and fires low!

1386
01:12:37.519 --> 01:12:38.520
{\an8}Low left!

1387
01:12:38.587 --> 01:12:41.056
{\an8}And that brings us to the end of Round 3!

1388
01:12:45.260 --> 01:12:46.462
Bravo!

1389
01:12:47.896 --> 01:12:52.234
He's showing how you nullify
a power fighter with technique.

1390
01:12:53.068 --> 01:12:54.937
You're doing well. You won this round.

1391
01:12:55.804 --> 01:12:59.308
He's not in his best form tonight.

1392
01:12:59.375 --> 01:13:03.479
[Lee] Ohgon took the first three rounds,
so this is not gonna be easy for Sungmin.

1393
01:13:04.480 --> 01:13:05.481
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

1394
01:13:06.949 --> 01:13:09.084
I feel like his stamina's dipped a bit.

1395
01:13:10.319 --> 01:13:12.221
<i>Trying to match Ohgon's speed,</i>

1396
01:13:12.287 --> 01:13:13.722
<i>I couldn't play my own game.</i>

1397
01:13:13.789 --> 01:13:16.392
<i>So I decided to work the short shots</i>
<i>and get my rhythm back.</i>

1398
01:13:16.959 --> 01:13:20.963
{\an8}[Lee] It's an impressive display
of veteran savvy from Kwon Ohgon.

1399
01:13:21.029 --> 01:13:24.066
{\an8}Meanwhile, Hong Sungmin
appears deep in tactical thought.

1400
01:13:25.200 --> 01:13:27.336
{\an8}- Now, into the fourth round.
- [bell dings]

1401
01:13:27.403 --> 01:13:28.704
{\an8}Box!

1402
01:13:28.771 --> 01:13:29.972
{\an8}Round 4 has now begun.

1403
01:13:30.038 --> 01:13:31.673
{\an8}KWON OHGON X HONG SUNGMIN

1404
01:13:32.741 --> 01:13:34.676
[Seungheon] Hong is still
finding his rhythm.

1405
01:13:37.146 --> 01:13:38.881
Kwon Ohgon looks confident enough.

1406
01:13:39.615 --> 01:13:40.716
[exclaims]

1407
01:13:45.921 --> 01:13:47.189
[spectator] Stay sharp!

1408
01:13:47.990 --> 01:13:48.991
Hong Sungmin strikes.

1409
01:13:50.058 --> 01:13:52.294
Nice left hand from Hong Sungmin!

1410
01:13:55.664 --> 01:13:56.665
[Jihyun] That's it!

1411
01:13:57.966 --> 01:13:59.768
That's it! Throw combos!

1412
01:14:01.236 --> 01:14:03.472
[Seungheon] Hong presses forward,
Kwon tightens his guard.

1413
01:14:05.040 --> 01:14:07.576
Hong Sungmin looks to the body.

1414
01:14:08.143 --> 01:14:10.412
He takes a counter to the body,
then slips a big shot!

1415
01:14:10.479 --> 01:14:12.815
[♪ intense music playing]

1416
01:14:12.881 --> 01:14:14.416
That was clean.

1417
01:14:14.983 --> 01:14:16.885
Hong Sungmin is starting to pick it up.

1418
01:14:16.952 --> 01:14:18.020
I can feel it.

1419
01:14:20.322 --> 01:14:21.990
There it is.

1420
01:14:22.057 --> 01:14:23.225
He's switched on.

1421
01:14:23.792 --> 01:14:25.294
We're getting some of this action.

1422
01:14:25.360 --> 01:14:27.162
- You mean dancing.
- Right, "dancing."

1423
01:14:31.300 --> 01:14:33.902
[Seungheon] Kwon changes levels,
but Hong stays with him.

1424
01:14:34.670 --> 01:14:37.005
[Lee] He keeps working the body,
trying to slow him down.

1425
01:14:39.608 --> 01:14:41.009
He comes over the top again!

1426
01:14:41.543 --> 01:14:44.580
Ohgon is no easy opponent, though.

1427
01:14:44.646 --> 01:14:46.482
[Seungheon] Kwon slips the left
and angles out.

1428
01:14:46.548 --> 01:14:48.116
Hong keeps up the chase.

1429
01:14:50.586 --> 01:14:51.820
Short shots from Hong!

1430
01:14:54.523 --> 01:14:55.524
And here's the left!

1431
01:14:58.193 --> 01:15:00.362
That shot just spun Kwon off to the side!

1432
01:15:03.966 --> 01:15:05.634
{\an8}He keeps pressing. Ten seconds!

1433
01:15:10.639 --> 01:15:12.674
{\an8}Final push from Hong Sungmin.
Here he comes.

1434
01:15:13.408 --> 01:15:14.676
{\an8}[bell dings]

1435
01:15:17.079 --> 01:15:18.447
And that concludes this round!

1436
01:15:26.855 --> 01:15:28.824
Here we go.
Sungmin's starting to move like this.

1437
01:15:29.324 --> 01:15:31.360
He's gonna run these last two.

1438
01:15:32.661 --> 01:15:34.730
[Lee] He needs to show more.

1439
01:15:35.430 --> 01:15:36.565
You're not doing too badly.

1440
01:15:36.632 --> 01:15:39.368
I think you can take this round.

1441
01:15:39.434 --> 01:15:41.803
Just fire short shots.
He ate every single one.

1442
01:15:41.870 --> 01:15:43.272
Your tempo's good.

1443
01:15:44.273 --> 01:15:45.407
You don't need to move much.

1444
01:15:45.474 --> 01:15:46.775
Save it for the last round.

1445
01:15:48.777 --> 01:15:50.245
[spectator] Just have fun
with it, Sungmin!

1446
01:15:51.346 --> 01:15:53.448
- Let's go, Sungmin!
- Let's go!

1447
01:15:54.082 --> 01:15:55.717
<i>Now's the time to really serve.</i>

1448
01:15:57.152 --> 01:15:58.453
{\an8}KWON OHGON X HONG SUNGMIN

1449
01:15:58.520 --> 01:15:59.521
{\an8}Box!

1450
01:16:00.022 --> 01:16:00.989
{\an8}Round 5 begins.

1451
01:16:01.490 --> 01:16:05.027
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KWON: 39, HONG: 37

1452
01:16:05.093 --> 01:16:06.461
{\an8}[spectator 2] Remember, short and sweet.

1453
01:16:06.528 --> 01:16:07.529
{\an8}Use the left.

1454
01:16:12.034 --> 01:16:14.236
All right! Just hang in there!

1455
01:16:14.303 --> 01:16:17.406
[Lee] Hong Sungmin sure is throwing
a lot of light jabs today.

1456
01:16:17.472 --> 01:16:20.509
He's just not letting his hands go
like he usually does.

1457
01:16:21.209 --> 01:16:23.211
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1458
01:16:26.715 --> 01:16:30.185
[Sungmin] <i>I wanted to get</i>
<i>a read on him first.</i>

1459
01:16:31.620 --> 01:16:34.022
<i>When I lightly touched his guard,</i>

1460
01:16:34.089 --> 01:16:35.357
<i>he never fired back.</i>

1461
01:16:37.859 --> 01:16:39.428
All right!

1462
01:16:39.995 --> 01:16:43.198
<i>But when I stepped it up and hit harder,</i>
<i>punches came right away.</i>

1463
01:16:45.667 --> 01:16:49.004
<i>That was my moment to fire with impact.</i>

1464
01:16:50.172 --> 01:16:53.041
[Seungheon] Hong Sungmin's starting
the fifth round a little differently.

1465
01:16:57.579 --> 01:16:59.281
[spectators gasping]

1466
01:17:12.894 --> 01:17:15.564
[Gyuwon] Even while firing combos,
he controls the pace!

1467
01:17:15.631 --> 01:17:17.199
And that's why he's landing clean!

1468
01:17:18.367 --> 01:17:20.135
- Come on!
- Don't let him hit you!

1469
01:17:20.869 --> 01:17:22.604
Kwon's looking a bit surprised there.

1470
01:17:22.671 --> 01:17:25.173
- Even so, Kwon Ohgon fires back hard!
- Nice one!

1471
01:17:25.240 --> 01:17:26.241
Left double!

1472
01:17:26.742 --> 01:17:28.010
Triple!

1473
01:17:28.076 --> 01:17:30.212
Even a fourth,
but Sungmin slips this time!

1474
01:17:31.680 --> 01:17:34.549
[Jihyun] One-two! One-two, that's it!

1475
01:17:34.616 --> 01:17:36.785
Now's the time to own the inside!

1476
01:17:40.155 --> 01:17:41.890
That's it!

1477
01:17:41.957 --> 01:17:43.291
He got caught!

1478
01:17:49.364 --> 01:17:50.866
Sungmin's in the zone.

1479
01:17:57.172 --> 01:17:58.173
This is intense!

1480
01:17:58.740 --> 01:18:00.609
[Seungheon] He's using
his upper body and footwork,

1481
01:18:00.676 --> 01:18:02.744
slowly steering Kwon into the corner!

1482
01:18:05.180 --> 01:18:08.250
As Hong Sungmin's rhythm picks up,
it's clearly making Kwon uncomfortable.

1483
01:18:10.385 --> 01:18:11.386
That's it!

1484
01:18:21.396 --> 01:18:23.065
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Stop!

1485
01:18:24.366 --> 01:18:26.768
And that's it for Round 5!

1486
01:18:26.835 --> 01:18:31.006
What a high-level boxing match
these two are putting on.

1487
01:18:33.675 --> 01:18:36.878
Doing awesome! You got this!

1488
01:18:38.280 --> 01:18:39.648
Just one more round to go!

1489
01:18:40.215 --> 01:18:41.416
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

1490
01:18:43.018 --> 01:18:44.786
- Hong's not putting any combos together.
- No.

1491
01:18:44.853 --> 01:18:46.955
He's landing some single shots,

1492
01:18:47.022 --> 01:18:48.890
- but he's just…
- Not pouring it on?

1493
01:18:49.458 --> 01:18:50.892
But it's the final round.

1494
01:18:51.493 --> 01:18:53.829
If he doesn't score a knockout,

1495
01:18:54.396 --> 01:18:56.064
Sungmin's chances are running thin.

1496
01:18:56.131 --> 01:18:58.300
He's got to step on it now.

1497
01:19:00.102 --> 01:19:01.770
- Well done.
- Thanks.

1498
01:19:01.837 --> 01:19:03.071
- Stay sharp.
- Got it.

1499
01:19:05.006 --> 01:19:06.074
Leave everything out there.

1500
01:19:07.175 --> 01:19:10.679
[Ohgon] <i>This time,</i>
<i>I have to put him on the canvas.</i>

1501
01:19:10.746 --> 01:19:12.647
<i>I'll counter everything he throws my way.</i>

1502
01:19:13.582 --> 01:19:16.551
[Sungmin] <i>I'm gonna empty the tank</i>
<i>in the final round.</i>

1503
01:19:17.586 --> 01:19:19.721
Let's get the final sixth round
of the day started.

1504
01:19:20.288 --> 01:19:22.591
[Ohgon] <i>I just want to fight</i>
<i>with all my might.</i>

1505
01:19:22.657 --> 01:19:25.160
[Sungmin] <i>I'm just gonna have fun,</i>
<i>lighting it up.</i>

1506
01:19:25.761 --> 01:19:27.395
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Box!

1507
01:19:27.462 --> 01:19:30.098
{\an8}[Seungheon] Hong Sungmin versus Kwon Ohgon
now enters the final round.

1508
01:19:30.165 --> 01:19:31.166
{\an8}[spectator] Let's go, Sungmin!

1509
01:19:31.233 --> 01:19:32.567
{\an8}KWON OHGON X HONG SUNGMIN

1510
01:19:32.634 --> 01:19:35.604
[Gyuwon, laughing] Kwon Ohgon is
pushing to dominate here,

1511
01:19:35.670 --> 01:19:37.472
determined not to let the momentum slip.

1512
01:19:38.774 --> 01:19:41.676
[Lee] He's staying aggressive
so the momentum doesn't shift.

1513
01:19:49.985 --> 01:19:51.887
[Seungheon] He tries a big double there.

1514
01:19:51.953 --> 01:19:54.256
Ohgon's energy is unbelievable tonight.

1515
01:19:54.322 --> 01:19:56.124
He's practically flying around.

1516
01:19:59.661 --> 01:20:00.729
Nice double shot!

1517
01:20:01.563 --> 01:20:02.964
Both search for openings.

1518
01:20:04.800 --> 01:20:06.601
[Lee] Sungmin's gotta go now.
The clock's ticking.

1519
01:20:10.205 --> 01:20:12.974
[Sungmin] <i>It's the last round,</i>
<i>so I might as well go crazy.</i>

1520
01:20:14.075 --> 01:20:17.012
- Empty the tank! Leave it all in there!
- Keep going!

1521
01:20:18.747 --> 01:20:21.283
[Lee] Go for it! Time's running out!

1522
01:20:23.919 --> 01:20:25.320
[Seungheon] Hong Sungmin fires back.

1523
01:20:31.560 --> 01:20:33.061
That was a dangerous counter cross!

1524
01:20:35.363 --> 01:20:36.965
Clean shot!

1525
01:20:37.032 --> 01:20:38.200
Hong follows up!

1526
01:20:38.266 --> 01:20:39.968
Kwon Ohgon fires back with big shots!

1527
01:20:40.735 --> 01:20:42.404
They're pushing to end it here!

1528
01:20:47.542 --> 01:20:49.311
Kwon Ohgon swings big and eats one!

1529
01:20:52.013 --> 01:20:53.281
Stay on him!

1530
01:20:53.815 --> 01:20:57.252
- Come on!
- Let's go!

1531
01:20:59.988 --> 01:21:01.556
{\an8}Full swings from both fighters!

1532
01:21:02.924 --> 01:21:05.126
{\an8}They're letting the big shots fly!

1533
01:21:05.193 --> 01:21:06.795
{\an8}- That was an all-out exchange!
- [bell dings]

1534
01:21:07.262 --> 01:21:09.264
{\an8}[spectators cheering]

1535
01:21:13.368 --> 01:21:17.405
[Ohgon] <i>It felt like we both had the</i>
<i>same thought. "Leave it all out there."</i>

1536
01:21:18.440 --> 01:21:22.210
<i>If you're scared to get knocked out,</i>
<i>you can't throw punches like that.</i>

1537
01:21:31.553 --> 01:21:34.589
[Gyuwon] That showed us
exactly why boxing is

1538
01:21:34.656 --> 01:21:35.757
a form of art.

1539
01:21:39.628 --> 01:21:42.130
Man, he went the full six rounds.

1540
01:21:43.865 --> 01:21:46.968
- [Dex] Sungmin turned it up at the end.
- [Jongkook] He really did.

1541
01:21:47.035 --> 01:21:49.871
I liked how he threw those short punches

1542
01:21:49.938 --> 01:21:52.140
hunting for the big shots,

1543
01:21:52.207 --> 01:21:53.875
but he waited on it too long.

1544
01:21:54.409 --> 01:21:57.045
Hong Sungmin didn't throw
as much as usual.

1545
01:21:57.112 --> 01:21:58.747
- It just wasn't enough.
- No.

1546
01:21:58.813 --> 01:22:01.683
- But Kwon fought incredibly hard.
- Right.

1547
01:22:01.750 --> 01:22:04.386
He wasn't fazed by the size difference
and showed great timing.

1548
01:22:05.921 --> 01:22:07.889
We will now announce the result.

1549
01:22:08.990 --> 01:22:10.425
Who's it gonna be?

1550
01:22:11.693 --> 01:22:13.094
Honestly, whoever wins,

1551
01:22:13.161 --> 01:22:15.664
- it's well deserved.
- Totally.

1552
01:22:15.730 --> 01:22:17.766
Boy, my heart's pounding.

1553
01:22:19.601 --> 01:22:21.369
- [sighs]
- [laughs]

1554
01:22:21.436 --> 01:22:22.437
Was that scary?

1555
01:22:23.838 --> 01:22:26.942
[Jongkook] Judge one scores it for…

1556
01:22:30.912 --> 01:22:34.716
<i>We both fought hard,</i>
<i>right down to the wire.</i>

1557
01:22:35.750 --> 01:22:39.087
<i>I felt I landed the more impactful shots,</i>

1558
01:22:39.154 --> 01:22:42.157
<i>so I thought I might have the edge.</i>

1559
01:22:44.726 --> 01:22:46.428
{\an8}Hong Sungmin in the blue corner.

1560
01:22:46.494 --> 01:22:49.364
{\an8}JUDGE 1
BLUE CORNER HONG SUNGMIN WINS

1561
01:22:56.438 --> 01:22:58.473
Judge two scores it for…

1562
01:23:03.678 --> 01:23:05.347
{\an8}BOXING G.O.A.T CHAMP KWON OHGON

1563
01:23:08.850 --> 01:23:10.485
{\an8}Kwon Ohgon in the red corner!

1564
01:23:10.552 --> 01:23:12.620
{\an8}JUDGE 2
RED CORNER KWON OHGON WINS

1565
01:23:16.224 --> 01:23:17.926
Oh, my gosh!

1566
01:23:17.993 --> 01:23:21.296
The score is now one to one.

1567
01:23:22.464 --> 01:23:25.834
- This is not an easy call.
- It sure isn't.

1568
01:23:25.900 --> 01:23:30.405
Let's hear the third
and final judge's decision.

1569
01:23:31.006 --> 01:23:33.475
All right, the winner is…

1570
01:23:35.210 --> 01:23:37.712
<i>Still, I fought without regrets.</i>

1571
01:23:38.346 --> 01:23:41.416
<i>I honestly think I have it.</i>

1572
01:23:42.617 --> 01:23:44.586
[♪ tense music playing]

1573
01:23:52.727 --> 01:23:55.230
Kwon Ohgon in the red corner.

1574
01:23:56.097 --> 01:23:59.234
{\an8}The winner is Kwon Ohgon
in the red corner.

1575
01:24:00.402 --> 01:24:02.437
Really? Is this for real?

1576
01:24:02.504 --> 01:24:03.838
- Yeah.
- He won?

1577
01:24:08.376 --> 01:24:11.379
First, I want to thank Hong Sungmin

1578
01:24:11.446 --> 01:24:13.748
for putting up such a hard fight.

1579
01:24:14.249 --> 01:24:18.186
I'll keep pushing in the semifinals
and make it to the finals. Thank you.

1580
01:24:18.253 --> 01:24:20.522
- Let's go!
- It's the semifinals!

1581
01:24:23.725 --> 01:24:27.462
I may have taken a loss in the ring today,

1582
01:24:27.529 --> 01:24:29.197
but I'll keep working toward

1583
01:24:30.198 --> 01:24:33.034
the gold medals I want to win

1584
01:24:34.402 --> 01:24:35.603
throughout my career.

1585
01:24:35.670 --> 01:24:38.873
And Ohgon, thank you for the great fight.

1586
01:24:40.575 --> 01:24:42.544
- You did awesome!
- Very well fought!

1587
01:24:42.610 --> 01:24:45.080
- You did so well!
- You were great up there!

1588
01:24:49.884 --> 01:24:52.020
You did amazing up there.

1589
01:24:52.087 --> 01:24:53.421
- Took a lot of shots?
- Well done.

1590
01:24:53.488 --> 01:24:54.489
- I'm fine.
- Yeah?

1591
01:24:54.556 --> 01:24:58.026
<i>I was just living my life training hard,</i>

1592
01:24:58.093 --> 01:25:00.061
<i>and it paid off</i>

1593
01:25:00.128 --> 01:25:04.199
with an opportunity like <i>I Am Boxer.</i>

1594
01:25:04.265 --> 01:25:05.967
I'll let myself feel disappointed

1595
01:25:06.034 --> 01:25:07.469
and a bit sad today.

1596
01:25:07.535 --> 01:25:09.971
But I'll continue to move closer
to my dream,

1597
01:25:10.038 --> 01:25:13.007
so I hope you'll stay with me
on this journey.

1598
01:25:15.944 --> 01:25:18.513
She's just too nervous to speak right now.

1599
01:25:19.380 --> 01:25:23.118
<i>My wife's been working so hard</i>
<i>raising our kid, honestly.</i>

1600
01:25:23.184 --> 01:25:25.787
<i>I'm incredibly grateful to her.</i>

1601
01:25:25.854 --> 01:25:29.057
<i>She always wanted to see me box,</i>
<i>so I'm glad I finally showed her.</i>

1602
01:25:29.124 --> 01:25:31.593
I think I put on
a solid performance today,

1603
01:25:31.659 --> 01:25:33.161
so I'm pretty pleased about that.

1604
01:25:33.661 --> 01:25:35.730
I'll make sure to deliver

1605
01:25:35.797 --> 01:25:38.800
in the matches ahead,
so please look forward to it.

1606
01:25:40.668 --> 01:25:44.005
<i>I never imagined I'd make it this far.</i>

1607
01:25:44.072 --> 01:25:47.142
<i>One more win puts me in the finals.</i>

1608
01:25:47.208 --> 01:25:49.511
<i>The title's not that far away now.</i>

1609
01:25:50.111 --> 01:25:53.281
<i>I won't go down in the ring,</i>
<i>no matter what.</i>

1610
01:25:53.348 --> 01:25:56.417
- Let us begin the semifinals!
- Last round!

1611
01:25:56.484 --> 01:25:57.886
Pour it all out! All of it!

1612
01:25:57.952 --> 01:25:58.987
Go for it now!

1613
01:25:59.787 --> 01:26:01.656
- He's staggering!
- Real damage on Cho Hyunjae!

1614
01:26:01.723 --> 01:26:03.024
Real damage for sure!

1615
01:26:03.091 --> 01:26:04.225
Your parents are watching.

1616
01:26:04.292 --> 01:26:05.760
Keep going for your mom.

1617
01:26:05.827 --> 01:26:07.962
It's not over until it's over!

1618
01:26:08.029 --> 01:26:10.064
Anything can change in a heartbeat!

1619
01:26:10.131 --> 01:26:11.633
The winner of this match is…

1620
01:26:12.133 --> 01:26:13.535
Let's begin

1621
01:26:14.202 --> 01:26:16.337
the finals of<i> I Am Boxer.</i>

1622
01:26:18.606 --> 01:26:20.208
Let's do this!

1623
01:26:20.708 --> 01:26:22.644
A special performance by ATEEZ!

1624
01:26:23.611 --> 01:26:26.014
The fact that this matchup

1625
01:26:26.080 --> 01:26:28.416
even came together is unbelievable.

1626
01:26:28.483 --> 01:26:29.584
Is this for real?

1627
01:26:29.651 --> 01:26:31.152
That punch looks lethal.

1628
01:26:31.653 --> 01:26:35.323
